{"step_index":133,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-28T03:04:23Z","thinking":"Examining the controller structure, the root level encompasses essential system infrastructure components. These include authentication, error handling, session management, and user profile management, along with cache management utilities. This organization suggests a clear separation of concerns, with core system functions residing at the base level.\n\n\nThe application's structure shows distinct modules. The base level handles core system functions; specific modules manage location and store expansion planning, each with a comprehensive set of controllers for various functionalities within their respective domains.\n\n\nThe \"Scope\" module contains controllers dedicated to managing store expansion, including temporary scopes, review files, yearly targets, and employee KPIs. It also includes controllers for route management, district summaries, and mass import functionalities. The \"MAT\" module appears to house master data and parameters with various controllers related to location status, types, actions, and contract statuses.\n\n\nThe \"Place\" module encompasses controllers related to location-specific data, including chain stores, statuses, types, roles, and associated user assignments. It also manages KPIs, user targets, referral systems, and reasons for delays. This structure suggests a focus on operational aspects of store location management.\n\nThe USR module appears dedicated to user access control based on geographical areas, containing controllers for user authorization matrices, province assignments, and district assignments. This design indicates a granular permission model tied to specific regions.\n\n\nThe system relies on external APIs, confirming no direct database connection exists within the current project; it operates as a Backend-For-Frontend gateway. It handles user interface delivery, authentication, permission caching, and API calls to downstream services. The repository contains an original project snapshot, providing context for migration or compatibility checks.\n\n\nThe project underwent a migration from a legacy framework to a modern one, transitioning from a non-SDK style to SDK-style. It maintains backward compatibility with an older frontend framework through custom adapters and shims. The migration includes containerization support via Docker.\n\nA configuration management system centrally manages environment-specific settings. A comprehensive suite of tests covers various aspects of the application. Documentation provides details on migration and development setup.\n\n\nThe system's architecture leverages a Backend-For-Frontend design with Web MVC and AngularJS, using stateless SSO and downstream APIs, incorporating multi-level caching and comprehensive logging. Directory structure separates source and target, and core components are organized across four domains.\n\nThe integrated infrastructure includes identity management, MDM, store location, and HRM APIs, along with Redis, Elasticsearch/Kibana, and cloud storage. The project migrated from a legacy .NET Framework to a modern .NET version, involving centralized configuration and a multi-tiered testing approach.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"# Sơ Đồ Tư Duy & Tổng Quan Kiến Trúc — `cci-store-location-web` (CoC.Web.Place)\\n\\n> **Dự án**: `cci-store-location-web` (Tên mã: `CoC.Web.Place` / `store-location-web`)  \\n> **Tổ chức**: Hệ thống Bán lẻ Con Cung (Nhóm: `4_STORE-LOCATION`)  \\n> **Mục đích**: Hệ thống Cổng thông tin & Web App Quản lý Mặt bằng, Khảo sát, Đàm phán và Lập kế hoạch Phát triển Chuỗi Cửa hàng Con Cung trên toàn quốc.  \\n> **Hiện trạng**: Đã hoàn tất nâng cấp từ **ASP.NET MVC 5 (.NET Framework 4.6.1)** sang **ASP.NET Core (.NET 10)**.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 1. Sơ Đồ Tư Duy Tổng Thể (System Mindmap)\\n\\n```mermaid\\nmindmap\\n  root((Store Location Web<br/>CoC.Web.Place))\\n    Nghiep Vu Cot Loi\\n      LOC - Quan Ly Mat Bang\\n        LocationIndex: Tra cuu, tim kiem mat bang\\n        LocationAdd / Edit / Detail: Ho so mat bang tiem nang\\n        LocationContract: Hop dong thue, gia thue, thoi han\\n        LocationComment / History: Nhat ky khao sat, danh gia\\n        LocationInfo / LocationRefer: Thong tin ky thuat, nguon gioi thieu\\n        LocationSigned: Mat bang da ky ket\\n      PLA - Ke Hoach & Pham Vi\\n        ScopeIndex / Add / Edit: Pham vi mo chuoi theo khu vuc\\n        ScopeTargetYearly: Chi tieu mo mat bang hang nam\\n        WorkGoalsByMonth: KPI thang cua chuyen vien mat bang\\n        ProvinceEmployeeTarget: Phan bo chi tieu theo tinh thanh\\n        RouteIndex / Edit: Lo trinh tuyen khao sat mat bang\\n        DistrictSummary: Tong hop mat do quan huyen\\n        ImportIndex: Import Excel danh sach mat bang\\n      MAT - Danh Muc & Tham So\\n        LocationStatus / LeasingStatus: Trang thai mat bang, tien do\\n        PlaceChainStore: Danh muc chuoi Con Cung, Toycity\\n        PlaceType: Loai hinh cua hang Standard, Supercenter\\n        PlaceRole / PlaceRole_User: Vai tro phap ly, thiet ke, PTMB\\n        ScopeLateReason: Danh muc ly do tre han tien do\\n        UtilityIndex: Tien ich ngoai khu truong hoc, cho, benh vien\\n      USR - Phan Quyen Dia Ban\\\n<truncated 11489 bytes>","Description":"\"Tạo file sơ đồ tư duy và tài liệu kiến trúc tổng thể cho repo cci-store-location-web\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"e:/Work/Place_Migrate/cci-store-location-web/MINDMAP_ARCHITECTURE.md\"","toolAction":"\"Writing MINDMAP_ARCHITECTURE.md\"","toolSummary":"\"Create Mindmap and Architecture file in repo\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
