{"step_index":520,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-28T07:48:15Z","thinking":"The codebase changes are now localized: an EPPlus dependency upgrade, a middleware addition, and test runner fixes within the target web project. This focused scope makes reviewing the impact much more manageable. The untracked files are documentation, so they should not impact functionality.\n\n\nA critical change dossier must be created for the identified bug. The failing test report pinpointed the vulnerability. The dossier's structure and content are being derived from the `DEV_GUIDE.md` document, ensuring adherence to the specified format. The bug ID, file location, and relevant test reports are being recorded in the dossier to facilitate future reference and tracking.\n\n\nThe IIS configuration blocking `.json` files combined with the automatic static files registration within the core library creates a conflict. The core library registers `UseStaticFiles` before the blocking middleware, allowing it to serve the static JSON file before the middleware can intercept the request. The fix involves ensuring the blocking middleware is registered before `UseStaticFiles`.\n\n\nThe middleware intercepts requests starting with `/content/DriveJson` and immediately returns a `404 Not Found` error, stopping the pipeline. This ensures the protected file cannot be downloaded. The local environment test demonstrates the fix, with a successful `404` status code.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"# TC-FUNC-001 – Chặn truy cập file client_secret trong thư mục DriveJson\\n\\n| Mã | Phạm vi | Tag | Người sửa | Ngày |\\n|---|---|---|---|---|\\n| TC-FUNC-001-chan-access-drivejson-client-secret | 02_target | fix/TC-FUNC-001-chan-access-drivejson-client-secret | | 2026-09-28 |\\n\\nLần chạy phát hiện: test-report-20260928-143542.md\\n\\n## Triệu chứng\\nTest `CoC.Web.Place.Functional.Tests.PipelineAndLoginTests.DriveJsonClientSecret_IsNotServed` bị FAIL:\\n- Request GET tới `/content/DriveJson/ResourceConcungVn/client_secret.json` trả về HTTP 200 OK thay vì HTTP 404 Not Found.\\n- Nội dung file chứa thông tin nhạy cảm `client_secret` của Google OAuth bị lộ ra ngoài qua HTTP.\\n\\n## Bản gốc\\nBản gốc trên IIS/.NET Framework:\\n- IIS không cấu hình mimeMap cho đuôi `.json` trong `Web.config`, do đó IIS tự động chặn và trả về lỗi (404/403) khi client cố truy cập file `.json` tĩnh.\\n- Thư mục `content/DriveJson` chỉ được sử dụng bởi code backend cũ (`GoogleDriveController`) đã được comment-out, không bao giờ dự kiến phục vụ công khai ra ngoài.\\n\\n## Nguyên nhân\\nTrong `02_target/CoC.Web.Place/Startup.cs`:\\n- Trong phương thức `Configure(IApplicationBuilder app, IWebHostEnvironment env)`:\\n  Dòng `Core.MVC.GlobalEngine.HostBuilderItem.ApplicationBuilderItem = app;` được gọi ở đầu hàm.\\n  Thư viện `CCI.Core.MVC` (v1.0.60) khi nhận `ApplicationBuilderItem = app` đã tự động đăng ký `app.UseStaticFiles()` trong setter nội bộ của nó.\\n- Middleware chặn `/content/DriveJson`:\\n  ```csharp\\n  app.Use(async (context, next) =>\\n  {\\n      if (context.Request.Path.StartsWithSegments(\\\"/content/DriveJson\\\", StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase))\\n      {\\n          context.Response.StatusCode = StatusCodes.Status404NotFound;\\n          return;\\n      }\\n      await next();\\n  });\\n  ```\\n  lại được khai báo bên dưới `HostBuilderItem.ApplicationBuilderItem = app;`. Do \n<truncated 1304 bytes>","Description":"\"Tạo hồ sơ bug TC-FUNC-001-chan-access-drivejson-client-secret theo quy ước V6 của DEV_GUIDE.md\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"e:\\\\Work\\\\Place_Migrate\\\\cci-store-location-web\\\\04_critical_change\\\\test-report-20260928-143542\\\\TC-FUNC-001-chan-access-drivejson-client-secret.md\"","toolAction":"\"Creating bug dossier\"","toolSummary":"\"Create bug dossier\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
