dev\r\n478: ```\r\n479: \r\n480: ### A6. Gắn tag fix\r\n481: \r\n482: ```bash\r\n483: SHA=$(git rev-parse HEAD)                            # commit fix vừa push\r\n484: git show --stat \"$SHA\"                               # phải có code/test và hồ sơ\r\n485: git tag -a fix/TC-DC-001-fix-sai-tong-tien \"$SHA\" \\\r\n486:   -m \"ref: 04_critical_change/test-net10-mssql-report-20260927-133204/TC-DC-001-fix-sai-tong-tien.md\" \\\r\n487:   -m \"files: $(git diff-tree --no-commit-id --name-only -r \"$SHA\" | paste -sd, -)\"\r\n488: git push origin fix/TC-DC-001-fix-sai-tong-tien\r\n489: ```\r\n490: \r\n491: Script migrate lại đọc hai dòng `ref:` và `files:`; không đổi định dạng này. Nội dung tag sau khi gắn trông như sau:\r\n492: \r\n493: ```text\r\n494: ref: 04_critical_change/test-net10-mssql-report-20260927-133204/TC-DC-001-fix-sai-tong-tien.md\r\n495: \r\n496: files: 02_target/net10_mssql/CoC.API.DC/Services/OrderService.cs,04_critical_change/test-net10-mssql-report-20260927-133204/TC-DC-001-fix-sai-tong-tien.md\r\n497: ```\r\n498: \r\n499: ### A7. Merge dev vào staging\r\n500: \r\n501: ```bash\r\n502: git switch dev && git pull --ff-only origin dev\r\n503: \r\n504: git fetch origin staging10\r\n505: git switch -C staging10 FETCH_HEAD\r\n506: git merge --no-edit dev                              # conflict: xem mục 4.2\r\n507: git push origin staging10\r\n508: \r\n509: git fetch origin staging\r\n510: git switch -C staging FETCH_HEAD\r\n511: git merge --no-edit dev\r\n512: git push origin staging\r\n513: \r\n514: git switch dev\r\n515: ```\r\n516: \r\n517: Conflict ở file cấu hình: `git checkout --ours <file>`, `git add <file>`, `git commit --no-edit`. Conflict ở file code: `git merge --abort` rồi hỏi lead.\r\n518: \r\n519: ### A8. Kiểm tra staging đã có fix\r\n520: \r\nThe above content does NOT show the entire file contents. If you need to view any lines of the file which were not shown to complete your task, call this tool again to view those lines.\n"}
