{"step_index":1759,"source":"MODEL","type":"VIEW_FILE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-29T10:44:09Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-29T17:44:09+07:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-29T17:44:09+07:00\nFile Path: `file:///e:/Work/Place_Migrate/cci-store-location-web/Makefile`\nTotal Lines: 197\nTotal Bytes: 9855\nShowing lines 100 to 197\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n100: \t\telse \\\n101: \t\t\techo \"    FAILED: $$url\"; \\\n102: \t\tfi; \\\n103: \t\trm -rf \"$$tmp\"; \\\n104: \tdone; \\\n105: \techo \"  Done\"\n106: \n107: # Xoá sạch toàn bộ file/thư mục trong 01_origin/ (kể cả project_info.json) — dùng khi muốn\n108: # pull lại từ đầu hoặc dọn snapshot code gốc không còn cần dùng.\n109: #   make remove_origin\n110: remove_origin:\n111: \t@rm -rf \"$(CURDIR)\"/01_origin\n112: \t@mkdir -p \"$(CURDIR)\"/01_origin\n113: \t@echo \"  Removed all files in 01_origin/\"\n114: \n115: # ===== config / port / build / run origin =====\n116: # Mo hinh: 00_docs/01_migration/04_dev_setup_playbook.md (ban goc: cci-mbm-web, cung ten file).\n117: \n118: # Doi so truyen thang cho script PowerShell / python:\n119: #   make run_origin ARGS=\"-Verify -Clean\"      |   make config ARGS=\"--diff\"\n120: ARGS ?=\n121: \n122: # Mo trinh duyet khi chay foreground. Mac dinh BAT, cho giong `cd 02_target && make run`.\n123: #   make run_origin OPEN=0     # khong mo\n124: # Chi ap cho run_origin. build_origin va verify_origin KHONG dung bien nay: verify chay\n125: # trong CI, mo trinh duyet o do la rac.\n126: # Neu ARGS da tu co -OpenBrowser thi khong them nua - PowerShell bao loi khi mot switch\n127: # duoc truyen hai lan.\n128: OPEN ?= 1\n129: OPEN_ORIGIN := $(if $(filter-out 0,$(OPEN)),-OpenBrowser,)\n130: \n131: # Python cho scripts/apply-env-config.py. Do python3 truoc roi den python: tren Windows\n132: # `python3` co khi chi la shim .cmd rieng cua tung may, khong the tin la luon co.\n133: PY ?= $(shell command -v python3 2>/dev/null || command -v python 2>/dev/null || echo python3)\n\n<truncated 1900 bytes>\nt non-SDK + packages.config nen KHONG dung duoc dotnet build/run.\n167: # Port lay tu <runPorts app=\"origin\"> trong app.config.\n168: #   make run_origin                       # restore + build + chay foreground, TU MO trinh duyet\n169: #   make run_origin OPEN=0                # khong mo trinh duyet\n170: #   make run_origin ARGS=\"-KillPort\"      # tu dung tien trinh dang giu port\n171: #   make run_origin ARGS=\"-NoBuild\"       # bo qua restore/build\n172: #\n173: # KHONG nhan ENV: script khong bom config, do la viec rieng cua `make config`. Muon origin\n174: # chay theo moi truong nao thi `make config ENV=<ten>` truoc - appSetting.config giu nguyen\n175: # gia tri da bom cho toi lan `make config` sau, nen chi can lam mot lan.\n176: run_origin:\n177: \t@$(PWSH) \"$(CURDIR)/scripts/run-origin.ps1\" $(if $(findstring OpenBrowser,$(ARGS)),,$(OPEN_ORIGIN)) $(ARGS)\n178: \n179: # Chi restore + build 01_origin, khong chay. Ban Debug duoc ep DebugType=portable de\n180: # breakpoint bind duoc trong VS Code (xem ghi chu trong scripts/run-origin.ps1).\n181: #   make build_origin\n182: #   make build_origin ARGS=\"-Clean\"\n183: build_origin:\n184: \t@$(PWSH) \"$(CURDIR)/scripts/run-origin.ps1\" -BuildOnly $(ARGS)\n185: \n186: # Build, chay IIS Express o nen, goi trang chu, in PASS/FAIL roi tat. Exit code khac 0 khi\n187: # fail nen dung duoc trong CI. 200/301/302 deu tinh la khoe (chua dang nhap thi / redirect\n188: # sang /accounts/login).\n189: #   make verify_origin\n190: verify_origin:\n191: \t@$(PWSH) \"$(CURDIR)/scripts/run-origin.ps1\" -Verify $(ARGS)\n192: \n193: # ===== target (.NET 10) =====\n194: # Cac lenh build/run/verify/test cua target nam trong 02_target/Makefile (dotnet CLI, Kestrel).\n195: #   cd 02_target && make run       |   make verify   |   make build   |   make test\n196: # Port cua target cung lay tu <runPorts app=\"target\"> trong app.config o root.\n197: \nThe above content does NOT show the entire file contents. If you need to view any lines of the file which were not shown to complete your task, call this tool again to view those lines.\n","truncated_fields":["content"]}
