ion, with the parameters constructed, would be the next step.\n\n\nA `NullReferenceException` is highly probable if the model binding fails when deserializing the request body into the `obj` parameter.  Model binding failure would result in `obj` being null, which would then cause an error when trying to access `obj.ScopeIDs`.  This would be triggered by an unsupported `Content-Type` or invalid JSON in the request.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"view_file","args":{"AbsolutePath":"\"e:/Work/Place_Migrate/cci-store-location-web/01_origin/CoC.Web.Place/Controllers/HomeController.cs\"","EndLine":"90","StartLine":"70","toolAction":"\"Viewing file\"","toolSummary":"\"View 01_origin HomeController.cs lines 70-90\""}}]}
