{"step_index":2653,"source":"MODEL","type":"GREP_SEARCH","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-30T03:59:43Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-30T10:59:43+07:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-30T10:59:43+07:00\n{\"File\":\"e:\\\\Work\\\\Place_Migrate\\\\cci-store-location-web\\\\DEV_GUIDE.md\",\"LineNumber\":35,\"LineContent\":\"| `staging10` | Bản .NET 10 chạy **MSSQL** | `*-stg10.concung.vn` | Test migration trên MSSQL |\"}\n{\"File\":\"e:\\\\Work\\\\Place_Migrate\\\\cci-store-location-web\\\\DEV_GUIDE.md\",\"LineNumber\":39,\"LineContent\":\"Merge vào nhánh nào thì vào Jenkins bấm **Build** job của nhánh đó để deploy ra domain tương ứng, ví dụ job `mbm-api-stg10` cho nhánh `staging10`. Link job của từng repo nằm trong [Project Summary](https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1bZorIhRGC_pwU9u2G5MsbhQGEkkQJ-rTAX9cHd0mZwc/edit?gid=1206410779#gid=1206410779). Dev tự làm, không phải nhờ ai.\"}\n{\"File\":\"e:\\\\Work\\\\Place_Migrate\\\\cci-store-location-web\\\\DEV_GUIDE.md\",\"LineNumber\":57,\"LineContent\":\"    D --\\u003e E[\\\"4. Merge dev vào staging10 và staging\\u003cbr/\\u003ebấm Build trên Jenkins\\\"]\"}\n{\"File\":\"e:\\\\Work\\\\Place_Migrate\\\\cci-store-location-web\\\\DEV_GUIDE.md\",\"LineNumber\":103,\"LineContent\":\"| Cây code .NET 10 | Hai cây: `02_target/net10_mssql/` (→ `staging10`) và `02_target/net10_postgresql/` (→ `staging`) | Một cây: `02_target/`, cả hai staging dùng chung |\"}\n{\"File\":\"e:\\\\Work\\\\Place_Migrate\\\\cci-store-location-web\\\\DEV_GUIDE.md\",\"LineNumber\":185,\"LineContent\":\"| `staging10` | `NET10_MSSQL_BASE_URL=https://dc-api-stg10.concung.vn` | `make test-net10-mssql` |\"}\n{\"File\":\"e:\\\\Work\\\\Place_Migrate\\\\cci-store-location-web\\\\DEV_GUIDE.md\",\"LineNumber\":233,\"LineContent\":\"| `staging10` | `LOCAL_BASE_URL=https://hrm-web-stg10.concung.vn npx playwright test --project=e2e` |\"}\n{\"File\":\"e:\\\\Work\\\\Place_Migrate\\\\cci-store-location-web\\\\DEV_GUIDE.md\",\"LineNumber\":246,\"LineContent\":\"Code đi một chiều: commit lên `dev` → merge `dev` vào `staging10` và `staging` → bấm Build trên Jenkins.\"}\n{\"File\":\"e:\\\\Work\\\\Place_Migrate\\\\cci-store-location-web\\\\DEV_GUIDE.md\",\"LineNumber\":257,\"LineContent\":\"1. Merge `dev` vào `staging10` \n<truncated 497 bytes>\ndit?gid=1206410779#gid=1206410779).\"}\n{\"File\":\"e:\\\\Work\\\\Place_Migrate\\\\cci-store-location-web\\\\DEV_GUIDE.md\",\"LineNumber\":304,\"LineContent\":\"Tái hiện lỗi trên `staging10` và `staging` bằng bộ test hoặc test tay ([mục 3](#3-kiểm-thử-và-portal-report)). Môi trường chưa deploy được ([mục 4.2](#42-deploy-lên-staging)) thì tái hiện trên máy và ghi `BLOCKED` cho môi trường đó. Cần biết bản gốc có cùng hành vi không thì so thêm với `staging4`.\"}\n{\"File\":\"e:\\\\Work\\\\Place_Migrate\\\\cci-store-location-web\\\\DEV_GUIDE.md\",\"LineNumber\":399,\"LineContent\":\"Dev tự merge `dev` vào `staging10` và `staging`, push, rồi bấm Build trên Jenkins. Xem [mục 4.2](#42-deploy-lên-staging).\"}\n{\"File\":\"e:\\\\Work\\\\Place_Migrate\\\\cci-store-location-web\\\\DEV_GUIDE.md\",\"LineNumber\":457,\"LineContent\":\"Ví dụ API, repo `dc-api`, test file nhà cung cấp trên `staging10`:\"}\n{\"File\":\"e:\\\\Work\\\\Place_Migrate\\\\cci-store-location-web\\\\DEV_GUIDE.md\",\"LineNumber\":504,\"LineContent\":\"git fetch origin staging10\"}\n{\"File\":\"e:\\\\Work\\\\Place_Migrate\\\\cci-store-location-web\\\\DEV_GUIDE.md\",\"LineNumber\":505,\"LineContent\":\"git switch -C staging10 FETCH_HEAD\"}\n{\"File\":\"e:\\\\Work\\\\Place_Migrate\\\\cci-store-location-web\\\\DEV_GUIDE.md\",\"LineNumber\":507,\"LineContent\":\"git push origin staging10\"}\n{\"File\":\"e:\\\\Work\\\\Place_Migrate\\\\cci-store-location-web\\\\DEV_GUIDE.md\",\"LineNumber\":523,\"LineContent\":\"for BR in staging10 staging; do\"}\n{\"File\":\"e:\\\\Work\\\\Place_Migrate\\\\cci-store-location-web\\\\DEV_GUIDE.md\",\"LineNumber\":531,\"LineContent\":\"Dùng `FETCH_HEAD` thay vì `origin/staging10` vì `origin/*` trên máy có thể đã c