{"step_index":2692,"source":"MODEL","type":"VIEW_FILE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-30T04:21:20Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-30T11:21:20+07:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-30T11:21:20+07:00\nFile Path: `file:///e:/Work/Place_Migrate/cci-store-location-web/app.uat.config`\nTotal Lines: 125\nTotal Bytes: 9243\nShowing lines 1 to 60\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1: <?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"utf-8\"?>\r\n2: <!--\r\n3:   BAN UAT - dung `make config ENV=uat` de ap. Cung key-set + thu tu voi app.config (staging, ban\r\n4:   mac dinh) - xem header tung section o do (Doc boi / Thieu / Theo env / Bay); file nay chi doi\r\n5:   GIA TRI ve snapshot goc 01_origin/CoC.Web.Place/appSetting.config + Web.config\r\n6:   (coc.web.place@master10 d1299579, pull 2026-09-15, moi truong UAT).\r\n7: \r\n8:   Khac voi app.config (staging):\r\n9:     - IDS: ids1-uat.concung.vn/realms/master; client UAT place-uat.concung.vn /\r\n10:       place-uat.ClientCredential / place-api-uat. ClientCredentialSecret da chay that\r\n11:       2026-09-15: ClientPermissionWorker lay token 200 + MDM ReadClient 200 (T001 boot log).\r\n12:     - IssueUrl: concung.com (gia tri goc, chi dung o nhanh IdentityServer cu).\r\n13:     - SubcribeChanelNames: place-uat.concung.vn (khop ClientName).\r\n14:     - ApisUrl/HRMApisUrl/MDMUrl: host UAT that (place-api-uat, hrm-api-uat, mdm1-api-uat).\r\n15:     - Port: target 4784 = port DUY NHAT ids1-uat whitelist cho place-uat.concung.vn (do 2026-09-15:\r\n16:       4784 200; 4205, 5305, 4783, 4785, 4786, 4790, 5784 deu 400 Invalid parameter: redirect_uri).\r\n17:       Origin 4205 (khac target de chay song song) - origin BUILD va CHAY duoc nhung KHONG dang nhap\r\n18:       SSO duoc voi ban UAT cho toi khi admin IDS them localhost:4205 cho place-uat