{"step_index":2696,"source":"MODEL","type":"VIEW_FILE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-30T04:27:00Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-30T11:27:00+07:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-30T11:27:00+07:00\nFile Path: `file:///e:/Work/Place_Migrate/cci-store-location-web/Makefile`\nTotal Lines: 197\nTotal Bytes: 9855\nShowing lines 100 to 145\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n100: \t\telse \\\n101: \t\t\techo \"    FAILED: $$url\"; \\\n102: \t\tfi; \\\n103: \t\trm -rf \"$$tmp\"; \\\n104: \tdone; \\\n105: \techo \"  Done\"\n106: \n107: # Xoá sạch toàn bộ file/thư mục trong 01_origin/ (kể cả project_info.json) — dùng khi muốn\n108: # pull lại từ đầu hoặc dọn snapshot code gốc không còn cần dùng.\n109: #   make remove_origin\n110: remove_origin:\n111: \t@rm -rf \"$(CURDIR)\"/01_origin\n112: \t@mkdir -p \"$(CURDIR)\"/01_origin\n113: \t@echo \"  Removed all files in 01_origin/\"\n114: \n115: # ===== config / port / build / run origin =====\n116: # Mo hinh: 00_docs/01_migration/04_dev_setup_playbook.md (ban goc: cci-mbm-web, cung ten file).\n117: \n118: # Doi so truyen thang cho script PowerShell / python:\n119: #   make run_origin ARGS=\"-Verify -Clean\"      |   make config ARGS=\"--diff\"\n120: ARGS ?=\n121: \n122: # Mo trinh duyet khi chay foreground. Mac dinh BAT, cho giong `cd 02_target && make run`.\n123: #   make run_origin OPEN=0     # khong mo\n124: # Chi ap cho run_origin. build_origin va verify_origin KHONG dung bien nay: verify chay\n125: # trong CI, mo trinh duyet o do la rac.\n126: # Neu ARGS da tu co -OpenBrowser thi khong them nua - PowerShell bao loi khi mot switch\n127: # duoc truyen hai lan.\n128: OPEN ?= 1\n129: OPEN_ORIGIN := $(if $(filter-out 0,$(OPEN)),-OpenBrowser,)\n130: \n131: # Python cho scripts/apply-env-config.py. Do python3 truoc roi den python: tren Windows\n132: # `python3` co khi chi la shim .cmd rieng cua tung may, khong the tin la luon co.\n133: PY ?= $(shell command -v python3 2>/dev/null || command -v python 2>/dev/null || echo python3)\n134: \n135: # Chon file override theo moi truong:\n136: #   (bo trong)     -> app.config          - mac dinh, moi truong dang lam viec\n137: #   ENV=uat        -> app.uat.config\n138: #   ENV=<ten>      -> app.<ten>.config\n139: # Them moi truong moi = tao them mot file app.<ten>.config o root, khong phai sua Makefile.\n140: #\n141: # Luu y: `ENV` la bien moi truong co y nghia rieng trong POSIX sh. Make hut bien moi truong\n142: # vao lam bien cua no, nen may nao lo export ENV san thi `make config` se lang le chon nham\n143: # file. Ep rong o dong lenh cho chac:  make config ENV=\n144: ENV ?=\n145: ENV_FILE := $(if $(ENV),$(CURDIR)/app.$(ENV).config,$(CURDIR)/app.config)\nThe above content does NOT show the entire file contents. If you need to view any lines of the file which were not shown to complete your task, call this tool again to view those lines.\n"}
