{"step_index":2834,"source":"MODEL","type":"VIEW_FILE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-30T06:45:13Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-30T13:45:13+07:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-30T13:45:13+07:00\nFile Path: `file:///e:/Work/Place_Migrate/cci-store-location-web/AGENTS.md`\nTotal Lines: 161\nTotal Bytes: 6228\nShowing lines 1 to 100\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1: # coc.web.place — AGENTS.md\r\n2: \r\n3: > App này thuộc hệ thống Con Cung.\r\n4: \r\n5: ## OVERVIEW\r\n6: \r\n7: coc.web.place.\r\n8: \r\n9: ## STRUCTURE\r\n10: \r\n11: \r\n12: ---\r\n13: \r\n14: _Nội dung dưới đây là rules từ template [apps_agents.md](/.tmp/scripts/templates/apps_agents.md) — giữ lại để tham chiếu khi viết AGENTS.md_\r\n15: \r\n16: # App AGENTS.md Rules\r\n17: \r\n18: File này định nghĩa rules cho per-app AGENTS.md — file mô tả từng ứng dụng cụ thể.\r\n19: \r\n20: ## Required Sections\r\n21: \r\n22: Mỗi app AGENTS.md PHẢI có:\r\n23: \r\n24: ### 1. OVERVIEW (REQUIRED)\r\n25: \r\n26: 1-2 sentences: what the app does, who uses it, core tech (.NET version).\r\n27: \r\n28: ### 2. STRUCTURE (REQUIRED)\r\n29: \r\n30: ```\r\n31: {app}/\r\n32: ├── Controllers/       # API endpoints\r\n33: ├── Services/          # Business logic\r\n34: ├── Configs/           # Configuration\r\n35: └── ...\r\n36: ```\r\n37: \r\n38: ### 3. WHERE TO LOOK (REQUIRED)\r\n39: \r\n40: | Task | Location | Notes |\r\n41: |------|----------|-------|\r\n42: \r\n43: Map common tasks (add endpoint, add service, change config) to exact file paths.\r\n44: \r\n45: ### 4. TECH STACK\r\n46: \r\n47: - .NET version, ASP.NET Core / MVC / Web API\r\n48: - Authentication (JWT, IdentityServer, Cookie)\r\n49: - ORM (Dapper, EF Core)\r\n50: - DI container (Autofac, built-in)\r\n51: - Logging (Serilog, NLog)\r\n52: - Testing framework\r\n53: \r\n54: Nếu app không override, mặc định áp dụng **Baseline Rules Bắt Buộc** bên dưới.\r\n55: \r\n56: ### 5. BUILD & RUN\r\n57: \r\n58: ```bash\r\n59: # Build\r\n60: dotnet build {path/to/csproj}\r\n61: \r\n62: # Run\r\n63: dotnet run --project {path/to/csproj}\r\n64: ```\r\n65: \r\n66: Nêu rõ CI/CD status — nếu chưa có, ghi rõ \"No CI/CD — manual IIS deploy\" thay vì bỏ qua.\r\n67: \r\n68: ### 6. CONVENTIONS\r\n69: \r\n70: - Project structure patterns\r\n71: - Naming conventions\r\n72: - API route patterns\r\n73: - DI registration style\r\n74: \r\n75: ### 7. ANTI-PATTERNS (REQUIRED)\r\n76: \r\n77: Ít nhất 3 điều \"Never\" cụ thể cho app này — có thể kế thừa từ **Baseline Rules Bắt Buộc** và bổ\r\n78: sung thêm rule riêng.\r\n79: \r\n80: ### 8. TESTING\r\n81: \r\n82: Nếu KHÔNG có test project, ghi rõ \"No test project exists\" — không được bỏ qua im lặng.\r\n83: \r\n84: ## Quality Gates\r\n85: \r\n86: - 30-150 lines per file\r\n87: - No generic advice (phải specific cho app)\r\n88: - Telegraphic style\r\n89: \r\n90: ---\r\n91: \r\n92: ## Baseline Rules Bắt Buộc (Mandatory Defaults)\r\n93: \r\n94: Rule dưới đây được tổng hợp từ các rule **lặp lại ở ≥2 trong 3 project hiện có** (MBM, HRM,\r\n95: SOM) → coi là default bắt buộc khi khởi tạo app mới trong workspace này. Khi viết AGENTS.md cho\r\n96: app mới, copy các mục áp dụng được vào section TECH STACK / CONVENTIONS / ANTI-PATTERNS, chỉ\r\n97: override khi có lý do kỹ thuật rõ ràng (và phải ghi lý do override ngay trong AGENTS.md).\r\n98: \r\n99: ### Tech Stack mặc định\r\n100: \r\nThe above content does NOT show the entire file contents. If you need to view any lines of the file which were not shown to complete your task, call this tool again to view those lines.\n"}
