gration\\\\04_dev_setup_playbook.md\",\"LineNumber\":18,\"LineContent\":\"| Đổi sang UAT (test suite T002, QA) | `make config ENV=uat` rồi `make -C 02_target test`; xong `make config` |\"}\n{\"File\":\"e:\\\\Work\\\\Place_Migrate\\\\cci-store-location-web\\\\00_docs\\\\01_migration\\\\04_dev_setup_playbook.md\",\"LineNumber\":28,\"LineContent\":\"2. **Chạy test suite khi máy đang ở staging** — suite kiểm hợp đồng UAT (ids1-uat, `localhost:4784`); `run-tests.sh` dừng exit 2 kèm lệnh `make config ENV=uat`.\"}\n{\"File\":\"e:\\\\Work\\\\Place_Migrate\\\\cci-store-location-web\\\\00_docs\\\\01_migration\\\\04_dev_setup_playbook.md\",\"LineNumber\":76,\"LineContent\":\"app.config / app.uat.config  --(scripts/apply-env-config.py, make config [ENV=uat])--\\u003e\"}\n{\"File\":\"e:\\\\Work\\\\Place_Migrate\\\\cci-store-location-web\\\\00_docs\\\\01_migration\\\\04_dev_setup_playbook.md\",\"LineNumber\":91,\"LineContent\":\"| `make config ENV=uat ARGS=\\\"--diff\\\"` | appsettings.json **0** thay đổi (app.uat.config tái tạo đúng runtime UAT của T001); appSetting.config chỉ `ClientUrl` 4784→4205 + 13 key thêm |\"}\n{\"File\":\"e:\\\\Work\\\\Place_Migrate\\\\cci-store-location-web\\\\00_docs\\\\01_migration\\\\04_dev_setup_playbook.md\",\"LineNumber\":150,\"LineContent\":\"| Test suite T002 | 418/418 trên **UAT** (`tests/reports/test-report-20260915-033353.md`) | hợp đồng UAT; chạy lại cần `make config ENV=uat` |\"}\n{\"File\":\"e:\\\\Work\\\\Place_Migrate\\\\cci-store-location-web\\\\00_docs\\\\01_migration\\\\04_dev_setup_playbook.md\",\"LineNumber\":166,\"LineContent\":\"| `make -C 02_target test` hàng trăm test fail sau `make config` | máy đang ở staging (5305, ids1-stg), suite kiểm UAT | `run-tests.sh` dừng exit 2 kèm lệnh; chạy `make config ENV=uat` trước |\"}"}
