{"step_index":2873,"source":"MODEL","type":"VIEW_FILE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-30T07:07:57Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-30T14:07:57+07:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-30T14:07:57+07:00\nFile Path: `file:///e:/Work/Place_Migrate/cci-store-location-web/Makefile`\nTotal Lines: 202\nTotal Bytes: 10167\nShowing lines 140 to 180\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n140: # Chon file override theo moi truong:\n141: #   (bo trong)     -> app.config          - mac dinh, moi truong dang lam viec\n142: #   ENV=uat        -> app.uat.config\n143: #   ENV=<ten>      -> app.<ten>.config\n144: # Them moi truong moi = tao them mot file app.<ten>.config o root, khong phai sua Makefile.\n145: #\n146: # Luu y: `ENV` la bien moi truong co y nghia rieng trong POSIX sh. Make hut bien moi truong\n147: # vao lam bien cua no, nen may nao lo export ENV san thi `make config` se lang le chon nham\n148: # file. Ep rong o dong lenh cho chac:  make config ENV=\n149: ENV ?=\n150: ENV_FILE := $(if $(ENV),$(CURDIR)/app.$(ENV).config,$(CURDIR)/app.config)\n151: \n152: # Bom tham so phu thuoc moi truong tu app.config (root) vao config runtime cua CA HAI ben:\n153: #   01_origin/CoC.Web.Place/appSetting.config   (XML, file chinh cua origin - AppConfig.cs)\n154: #   01_origin/CoC.Web.Place/Web.config          (XML, file phu cua origin - chi key co san)\n155: #   02_target/CoC.Web.Place/appsettings.json    (JSON)\n156: # Idempotent: chay bao nhieu lan cung ra mot ket qua (merge lai tu ban .pristine).\n157: #   make config                          # ap ca hai, nguon la app.config\n158: #   make config ENV=uat                  # nguon la app.uat.config\n159: #   make config ARGS=\"--diff\"            # xem truoc, khong ghi\n160: #   make config ARGS=\"--restore\"         # tra config ve ban goc\n161: #   make config ARGS=\"--scope target\"\n162: config:\n163: \t@$(PY) -X utf8 \"$(CURDIR)/scripts/apply-env-config.py\" --env-file \"$(ENV_FILE)\" $(if $(deploy),--deploy,) $(ARGS)\n164: \n165: # Xem bang port cua origin/target (doc <runPorts> trong app.config) kem trang thai dang chay.\n166: #   make ports\n167: ports:\n168: \t@$(PWSH) \"$(CURDIR)/scripts/vscode-ports.ps1\"\n169: \n170: # Build + chay snapshot goc 01_origin (.NET Framework 4.6.1) bang MSBuild cua Visual Studio\n171: # + IIS Express - project non-SDK + packages.config nen KHONG dung duoc dotnet build/run.\n172: # Port lay tu <runPorts app=\"origin\"> trong app.config.\n173: #   make run_origin                       # restore + build + chay foreground, TU MO trinh duyet\n174: #   make run_origin OPEN=0                # khong mo trinh duyet\n175: #   make run_origin ARGS=\"-KillPort\"      # tu dung tien trinh dang giu port\n176: #   make run_origin ARGS=\"-NoBuild\"       # bo qua restore/build\n177: #\n178: # KHONG nhan ENV: script khong bom config, do la viec rieng cua `make config`. Muon origin\n179: # chay theo moi truong nao thi `make config ENV=<ten>` truoc - appSetting.config giu nguyen\n180: # gia tri da bom cho toi lan `make config` sau, nen chi can lam mot lan.\nThe above content does NOT show the entire file contents. If you need to view any lines of the file which were not shown to complete your task, call this tool again to view those lines.\n"}
