{"step_index":3010,"source":"MODEL","type":"VIEW_FILE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-30T08:02:08Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-30T15:02:08+07:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-30T15:02:08+07:00\nFile Path: `file:///e:/Work/Place_Migrate/cci-store-location-web/DEV_HANDBOOK.md`\nTotal Lines: 680\nTotal Bytes: 43040\nShowing lines 520 to 580\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n520: git diff --cached --stat                             # xem lại trước khi commit\n521: git commit -m \"fix(TC-DC01-021-sai-ma-loi-anonymous): tra 401 khi goi cancel khong token\"\n522: \n523: git switch dev\n524: git pull --ff-only origin dev\n525: git merge --no-ff --no-edit fix/TC-DC01-021-sai-ma-loi-anonymous   # conflict thì git merge --abort, hỏi lead\n526: git push origin dev\n527: \n528: git branch -d fix/TC-DC01-021-sai-ma-loi-anonymous\n529: git push origin --delete fix/TC-DC01-021-sai-ma-loi-anonymous      # chỉ khi đã từng push nhánh lên remote\n530: ```\n531: \n532: ### A6. Gắn tag fix\n533: \n534: Chạy ngay sau A5, khi `dev` đang ở commit merge vừa tạo.\n535: \n536: ```bash\n537: SHA=$(git rev-parse dev^2)                           # commit fix (cha thứ hai của commit merge)\n538: git show --stat \"$SHA\"                               # phải có code/test và hồ sơ\n539: git tag -a fix/TC-DC01-021-sai-ma-loi-anonymous \"$SHA\" \\\n540:   -m \"ref: 04_critical_change/test-net10-mssql-report-20260927-133204/TC-DC01-021-sai-ma-loi-anonymous.md\" \\\n541:   -m \"files: $(git diff-tree --no-commit-id --name-only -r \"$SHA\" | paste -sd, -)\"\n542: git push origin fix/TC-DC01-021-sai-ma-loi-anonymous\n543: ```\n544: \n545: Script migrate lại đọc hai dòng `ref:` và `files:`; không đổi định dạng này. Nội dung tag sau khi gắn trông như sau:\n546: \n547: ```text\n548: ref: 04_critical_change/test-net10-mssql-report-20260927-133204/TC-DC01-021-sai-ma-loi-anonymous.md\n549: \n550: files: 02_target/net10_mssql/CoC.API.DC/Controllers/SupplierOrdersController.cs,04_critical_change/test-net10-mssql-report-20260927-133204/TC-DC01-021-sai-ma-loi-anonymous.md\n551: ```\n552: \n553: ### A7. Merge dev vào staging\n554: \n555: ```bash\n556: git switch dev && git pull --ff-only origin dev\n557: \n558: git fetch origin staging10\n559: git switch -C staging10 FETCH_HEAD\n560: git merge --no-edit dev                              # conflict: xem mục 6.7\n561: git push origin staging10\n562: \n563: git fetch origin staging\n564: git switch -C staging FETCH_HEAD\n565: git merge --no-edit dev\n566: git push origin staging\n567: \n568: git switch dev\n569: ```\n570: \n571: Conflict ở file cấu hình: `git checkout --ours <file>`, `git add <file>`, `git commit --no-edit`. Conflict ở file code: `git merge --abort` rồi hỏi lead.\n572: \n573: ### A8. Kiểm tra staging đã có fix\n574: \n575: ```bash\n576: SHA=$(git rev-parse 'fix/TC-DC01-021-sai-ma-loi-anonymous^{commit}')\n577: for BR in staging10 staging; do\n578:   git fetch -q origin \"$BR\"\n579:   git merge-base --is-ancestor \"$SHA\" FETCH_HEAD \\\n580:     && echo \"$BR: đã có fix, SHA $(git rev-parse --short FETCH_HEAD)\" \\\nThe above content does NOT show the entire file contents. If you need to view any lines of the file which were not shown to complete your task, call this tool again to view those lines.\n"}
