tent/css/site.css` và `~/Content/css/reponsive.css` (lệ\n<truncated 2801 bytes>","Description":"\"Create bug dossier for TC-FUNC-004-case-insensitive-static-files-linux\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"e:/Work/Place_Migrate/cci-store-location-web/04_critical_change/test-report-20260930-141547/TC-FUNC-004-case-insensitive-static-files-linux.md\"","toolAction":"\"Creating file\"","toolSummary":"\"Create bug dossier TC-FUNC-004\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
