{"step_index":3221,"source":"MODEL","type":"VIEW_FILE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-01T03:06:42Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-01T10:06:42+07:00\nCompleted At: 2026-10-01T10:06:42+07:00\nFile Path: `file:///e:/Work/Place_Migrate/cci-store-location-web/00_docs/00_screen/44_login.md`\nTotal Lines: 155\nTotal Bytes: 6752\nShowing lines 1 to 40\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1: ---\r\n2: name: store-location-web-44\r\n3: version: 1.0.0\r\n4: summary: Đăng nhập/đăng xuất SSO qua Keycloak ids1-stg (/Accounts/Login, /Accounts/Callback, /Accounts/Logout)\r\n5: ---\r\n6: \r\n7: # 44 — Đăng nhập SSO (Keycloak)\r\n8: \r\n9: > **URL**: `/Accounts/Login`, `/Accounts/Callback`, `/Accounts/Logout`\r\n10: > **Controller**: `AccountsController` (`Controllers/AccountsController.cs`) — Login, Callback, Logout, RefreshToken\r\n11: > **AngularJS**: — (redirect server-side)\r\n12: > **Pattern**: Redirect OIDC code flow (không có View)\r\n13: > **Auth**: ẩn danh được phép\r\n14: \r\n15: ## 1. DOM Identifiers\r\n16: \r\n17: | Element | Selector | Ghi chú |\r\n18: |---|---|---|\r\n19: | Keycloak username | `input[name=\"username\"]` | trang `ConCung Identity Server` (`ids1-stg.concung.vn/realms/master`) |\r\n20: | Keycloak password | `input[name=\"password\"]` | |\r\n21: | Keycloak submit | `input[name=\"login\"]` (Keycloak) / `#btnLogin` (IDS cũ) | |\r\n22: | Dòng user (app) | `.loginuser-control a[href=\"/\"]` | `{username} - {họ tên}` sau khi đăng nhập |\r\n23: \r\n24: Authorize URL (NET4): `https://ids1-stg.concung.vn/realms/master/protocol/openid-connect/auth?client_id=place.concung.com&response_type=code&scope=openid%20place-api&redirect_uri=https%3A%2F%2Fplace-stg4.concung.vn%2Faccounts%2Fcallback&post_logout_redirect_uri=https%3A%2F%2Fplace-stg4.concung.vn%2F&response_mode=query&state=<32hex>&nonce=<32hex>`.\r\n25: \r\n26: ## 2. Features & UI States\r\n27: \r\n28: - **F1** — `Login`: tạo state/nonce, redirect authorize Keycloak.\r\n29: - **F2** — `Callback`: đổi code → token → `UserPrincipal` vào Session; lỗi → `/?oauth_error=1`.\r\n30: - **F3** — `Logout`: xoá Session; Keycloak → backchannel logout bằng refresh token → redirect `ClientUrl`.\r\n31: - **F4** — Mọi màn `[MvcAuthorize]` khi chưa có phiên → 302 `/accounts/login`.\r\n32: \r\n33: ## 3. Validation Rules\r\n34: \r\n35: | Field | Rule | Message |\r\n36: |---|---|---|\r\n37: | (form Keycloak) | sai mật khẩu | thông báo của Keycloak — ngoài phạm vi app (không test) |\r\n38: \r\n39: ## 4. User Journeys\r\n40: \r\nThe above content does NOT show the entire file contents. If you need to view any lines of the file which were not shown to complete your task, call this tool again to view those lines.\n"}
