{"step_index":3325,"source":"MODEL","type":"VIEW_FILE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-01T03:40:40Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-01T10:40:40+07:00\nCompleted At: 2026-10-01T10:40:41+07:00\nFile Path: `file:///e:/Work/Place_Migrate/cci-store-location-api/03_qa/.env.example`\nTotal Lines: 59\nTotal Bytes: 3410\nShowing lines 1 to 59\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1: # store-location-api — Playwright test env template (copy to .env, which is gitignored)\r\n2: #   make -f Makefile.windows setup    # tạo .env từ file này (lần đầu)\r\n3: #\r\n4: # Bearer token is fetched dynamically by the `setup` project (fixtures/auth.fixture.ts) via\r\n5: # real ids1-Keycloak SSO login (TEST_USERNAME/TEST_PASSWORD + IDS1_* below) → written to\r\n6: # .auth/token.json. This is the only token source (utils/auth-helpers.ts's loadAuthHeaders()).\r\n7: #\r\n8: # APP_ENV không set ở đây — cả 3 lệnh chạy test (make test-net10-mssql/test-net10-posgresql/\r\n9: # test-net4-mssql) đều tự truyền APP_ENV=... thẳng trên command line (xem Makefile), giá trị này\r\n10: # (nếu có) sẽ bị ghi đè nên không cần đặt default ở đây.\r\n11: \r\n12: # NET10_MSSQL: URL này quyết định `make test-net10-mssql` test vào ĐÂU.\r\n13: #   localhost / 127.0.0.1 -> Makefile tự build + start 02_target/net10_mssql trên port trong URL,\r\n14: #                            chạy test xong tự tắt (port 5104 = <runPorts> trong ../app.config)\r\n15: #   host remote           -> gọi thẳng, KHÔNG start gì (vd bản NET10 đã deploy: place-api-stg10)\r\n16: NET10_MSSQL_BASE_URL=http://localhost:5104\r\n17: \r\n18: # NET4_MSSQL: bản .NET Framework 4.6.1 gốc (chưa migrate), MSSQL — remote stg4\r\n19: # (không start local được; OWIN/IIS-only). DB: staging 192.168.13.135/Place (../app.config).\r\n20: NET4_MSSQL_BASE_URL=