{"step_index":3840,"source":"MODEL","type":"VIEW_FILE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-01T08:52:08Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-01T15:52:08+07:00\nCompleted At: 2026-10-01T15:52:08+07:00\nFile Path: `file:///e:/Work/Place_Migrate/cci-dc-web/00_docs/00_screen/00_README.md`\nTotal Lines: 14\nTotal Bytes: 605\nShowing lines 1 to 14\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1: # Danh mục màn hình dc-web (E2E)\r\n2: \r\n3: Oracle: NET4 https://dc-stg4.concung.vn/ — stg4 là chuẩn.\r\n4: \r\n5: | # | Màn | File | Spec | Trạng thái |\r\n6: |---|---|---|---|---|\r\n7: | 01 | Đăng nhập SSO | `01_login.md` | `03_qa/e2e/login/` | Đã sinh batch 1 |\r\n8: | 02 | Trang chủ / shell | `02_home.md` | `03_qa/e2e/home/` | Đã sinh batch 1 |\r\n9: \r\n10: App lớn — các màn còn lại (OutputOrders, InputOrders, DCStoreChanges, …) sinh tiếp bằng\r\n11: `qa-regen-web <màn>` theo playbook mục 3.\r\n12: \r\n13: **Lưu ý auth:** origin chỉ cho `UserTypeID == 3` vào Home; tài khoản NV (type 1) → Unauthorized.\r\n14: \nThe above content shows the entire, complete file contents of the requested file.\n"}
