c ApisUrl -\r\n20:        phai khai CA HAI, cung gia tri). Doi chieu bang trace-config-keys.py.\r\n21:     8. xoa moi dong TODO(dev-setup) da xu ly xong\r\n22: \r\n23:   Kiem tra truoc khi ban giao (thay [gach doi] bang hai\n<truncated 429 bytes>\nig goc, khong dua vao day:\r\n31:     versionFont, VersionJS, IsUseDonutOuputCache, DLLPrefix, InfrastructureConfigSectionName\r\n32:     webpages:Version, webpages:Enabled, ClientValidationEnabled, UnobtrusiveJavaScriptEnabled, config:CurrentTheme\r\n33:     PathDisplay, ClearMemoryCacheCMD, MaxSizeUpload\r\n34: \r\n35:   ClientUrl KHONG khai o day - phu thuoc tung app chu khong phai tung moi truong;\r\n36:   apply-env-config.py tu sinh tu <runPorts>.\r\n37: -->\r\n38: <configuration>\r\n39: \r\n40:   <!-- ===== 0. PORT =====\r\n41:        TODO(dev-setup): hai dong <add app=...> ben duoi dang BI COMMENT co y.\r\n42:        De nguyen nhu vay thi ca bon cho doc port deu DUNG HAN voi thong bao ro rang\r\n43:        (apply-env-config.py: \"runPorts thieu app=...\"; run-origin.ps1 va\r\n44:        vscode-ports.ps1: \"app.config khong co runPorts\"; Makefile cua tree:\r\n45:        \"$(error Khong doc duoc runPorts\")). Dat san mot so gia (0, 9999...) thi cac\r\n46:        lenh se CHAY voi port sai ma khong ai biet - nen thieu van hon sai.\r\n47:        Nguyen tac: origin va target KHONG dung chung port (de mo ca hai cung luc), va\r\n48:        port nam trong HOP DONG OAuth neu app ghep redirect_uri tu ClientUrl. Phai DO\r\n49:        tren IDS truoc khi chon:\r\n50:          curl -o /dev/null -w \"%{http_code}\" \"<ids>/protocol/openid-connect/auth\\\r\n51:            ?client_id=<client>&response_type=code&scope=openid\\\r\n52:            &redirect_uri=http%3A%2F%2Flocalhost%3A<port>%2Faccounts%2Fcallback\"\r\n53:        200 = da whitelist, 400 Invalid parameter: redirect_uri = chua. Ghi ket qua do\r\n54:        (ngay + tung port) vao day. Tranh port cua app khac trong workspace.\r\n55:   -->\r\n56:   <runPorts>\r\n57:     <!--