ient, URL and environment settings for `dc-stg10`.\n\n\nThe `appsettings.json` file contains an invalid JSON comment, which must be removed to prevent parsing errors during deployment. Investigating whether the corresponding K8s branch and image have been updated.\nA line-by-line comparison of the `appsettings.json` file is necessary to identify any additional configuration differences.\n\n\nThe provided configuration data reveals detailed environment settings including API URLs, logging endpoints, and vault configurations.  The `appsettings.json` file contains a JSON comment that will cause parsing failures with standard JSON parsers. Analysis shows `cci.core.json` and most of `appsettings.json` are identical to expected versions, indicating the comment is the only divergence in `appsettings.json`.\n\n\n"}
