{"step_index":4866,"source":"MODEL","type":"VIEW_FILE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-02T04:39:52Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-02T11:39:52+07:00\nCompleted At: 2026-10-02T11:39:52+07:00\nFile Path: `file:///e:/Work/Place_Migrate/cci-dc-web/.report/Makefile`\nTotal Lines: 50\nTotal Bytes: 1583\nShowing lines 1 to 50\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1: # Static QA web report viewer — Dc Web test JSON\n2: # Usage: make dev | make build | make verify | make open\n3: \n4: ifeq ($(OS),Windows_NT)\n5: PROGFILES := $(if $(ProgramW6432),$(ProgramW6432),$(ProgramFiles))\n6: GIT_ROOT  := $(subst \\,/,$(PROGFILES))/Git\n7: GIT_BASH  ?= $(GIT_ROOT)/usr/bin/bash.exe\n8: SHELL     := $(GIT_BASH)\n9: .SHELLFLAGS := -c\n10: export PATH := $(GIT_ROOT)/usr/bin;$(GIT_ROOT)/mingw64/bin;$(PATH)\n11: endif\n12: \n13: PY ?= $(shell command -v python3 2>/dev/null || command -v python 2>/dev/null || echo python3)\n14: \n15: PORT ?= 8932\n16: VIEWER_DIR := viewer\n17: BUILD := $(PY) $(VIEWER_DIR)/tools/build_data.py\n18: SERVE := $(PY) $(VIEWER_DIR)/tools/serve.py --port $(PORT) --directory $(VIEWER_DIR)\n19: \n20: .PHONY: help build dev open verify\n21: \n22: help:\n23: \t@echo \"Targets:\"\n24: \t@echo \"  make dev      Serve viewer o http://localhost:$(PORT)/ (build lai truoc)\"\n25: \t@echo \"  make build    Chi rebuild data.js\"\n26: \t@echo \"  make open     Mo viewer tren browser mac dinh\"\n27: \t@echo \"  make verify   build + kiem tra 200 cho index.html/app.js/data.js/styles.css\"\n28: \n29: build:\n30: \t$(BUILD)\n31: \n32: dev: build\n33: \t@echo \"Viewer: http://localhost:$(PORT)/ (Ctrl+C de dung)\"\n34: \t$(SERVE)\n35: \n36: open:\n37: \t@open \"http://localhost:$(PORT)/\" 2>/dev/null || xdg-open \"http://localhost:$(PORT)/\" 2>/dev/null || echo \"Mo tay: http://localhost:$(PORT)/\"\n38: \n39: verify: build\n40: \t@$(SERVE) >/tmp/web-viewer-verify-$(PORT).log 2>&1 & \\\n41: \tsrv=$$!; sleep 1; \\\n42: \tcode=0; \\\n43: \tfor f in index.html app.js data.js styles.css; do \\\n44: \t\tst=$$(curl -s -o /dev/null -w \"%{http_code}\" \"http://localhost:$(PORT)/$$f\"); \\\n45: \t\techo \"$$f -> $$st\"; \\\n46: \t\t[ \"$$st\" = \"200\" ] || code=1; \\\n47: \tdone; \\\n48: \tkill $$srv; \\\n49: \texit $$code\n50: \nThe above content shows the entire, complete file contents of the requested file.\n"}
