{"step_index":4870,"source":"MODEL","type":"VIEW_FILE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-02T04:40:09Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-02T11:40:09+07:00\nCompleted At: 2026-10-02T11:40:09+07:00\nFile Path: `file:///e:/Work/Place_Migrate/cci-dc-web/.report/viewer/tools/build_data.py`\nTotal Lines: 211\nTotal Bytes: 8429\nShowing lines 1 to 60\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1: #!/usr/bin/env python3\r\n2: \"\"\"Build embedded data.js for the static WEB report viewer.\r\n3: \r\n4: Reads:  dc-web/03_qa/reports/details/*.json  (schema: screens[] — xem\r\n5:         dc-web/03_qa/utils/json-reporter.ts; fallback routes[] cho report cũ)\r\n6: Writes: viewer/data.js  (window.__REPORT_DATA__ = { generatedAt, sources, payloads })\r\n7: \r\n8: Fork của dc-api/.report/viewer/tools/build_data.py — KHÔNG có bảng route swagger để\r\n9: chuẩn hoá (API có mbm_api.json, web thì screen lấy thẳng từ JSON, đã đúng feature do\r\n10: fixtures/evidence.fixture.ts + featureFromFile() xử lý lúc chạy test) nên không có\r\n11: load_routes()/match_route()/normalize_endpoints() — payload[\"screens\"] là JSON gốc, chỉ cắt\r\n12: bớt text console dài của scenario PASS (xem truncate_passed_console).\r\n13: \r\n14: Nguồn dữ liệu duy nhất được phép: 03_qa/reports/details/ (DEFAULT_DETAILS) — nghiêm cấm đọc\r\n15: từ nơi khác, nên --details không nhận override qua CLI (giống bản API).\r\n16: \r\n17: Usage:\r\n18:     python3 tools/build_data.py [--out data.js]\r\n19: \"\"\"\r\n20: import argparse\r\n21: import datetime\r\n22: import glob\r\n23: import hashlib\r\n24: import json\r\n25: import os\r\n26: import re\r\n27: import sys\r\n28: \r\n29: DEFAULT_DETAILS = os.path.normpath(os.path.join(os.path.dirname(os.path.abspath(__file__)), \"..\", \"..\", \"..\", \"03_qa\", \"reports\", \"details\"))\r\n30: \r\n31: # Console text của scenario PASS bị cắt ở đây thêm 1 lớp phòng thủ (evidence-helper.ts đã cắt\r\n32: # 500 ký tự/entry ở nguồn) — chỉ để chắc chắn data.js không phình nếu report cũ sinh trước khi\r\n33: # giới hạn đó tồn tại.\r\n34: PASSED_CONSOLE_LIMIT = 500\r\n35: \r\n36: \r\n37: def file_env(name: str) -> str:\r\n38:     low = name.lower()\r\n39:     if \"postgresql\" in low or \"posgresql\" in low or \"postgres\" in low or \"-pg-\" in low:\r\n40:         return \"POSTGRESQL\"\r\n41:     if \"mssql\" in low or \"sqlserver\" in low:\r\n42:         return \"MSSQL\"\r\n43:     # REPORT_PREFIX=test-net4 (03_qa/Makefile) — bản .NET Framework 4.6.1 gốc chưa migrate,\r\n44:     # remote NET4_BASE_URL (mbm-stg4/mbm-uat...). Kiểm tra SAU mssql/postgresql: \"net4\" không\r\n45:     # đụng 2 pattern trên nên thứ tự không quan trọng, nhưng giữ nhất quán chỗ đọc dễ.\r\n46:     if \"net4\" in low:\r\n47:         return \"NET4\"\r\n48:     return \"UNKNOWN\"\r\n49: \r\n50: \r\n51: def norm_env(env: str) -> str:\r\n52:     up = str(env or \"\").upper()\r\n53:     for token in (\"POSTGRESQL\", \"POSTGRES\", \"MSSQL\"):\r\n54:         if token in up:\r\n55:             return \"POSTGRESQL\" if token.startswith(\"POSTGRES\") else \"MSSQL\"\r\n56:     return up or \"UNKNOWN\"\r\n57: \r\n58: \r\n59: def truncate_passed_console(screens: list) -> list:\r\n60:     for rt in screens:\r\nThe above content does NOT show the entire file contents. If you need to view any lines of the file which were not shown to complete your task, call this tool again to view those lines.\n"}
