{"step_index":5320,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-06T08:54:42Z","thinking":"The initial focus is on how data is deserialized, specifically examining the case-insensitivity of the deserialization process. This requires understanding how the `APIClient` serializes data, prompting an investigation into its implementation. It is essential to determine where the `IAPIClient` interface is resolved. Checking the dependency registration will identify the concrete class used.\n\n\nLine 15's `using` statement confirms `APIClient` refers to the `Core.MVC.APIClient` class, defined within the `Core.MVC` namespace. This class implements the `IAPIClient` interface. The relevant source control module houses the definition of this class within the `LegacyMvcStubs.cs` file.\n\n\nThe `PostObject` method, despite accepting an `object`, effectively calls a generic `Post<object>` method, raising a concern. Serialization relies on `Newtonsoft.Json`, which serializes the runtime type of the object, not the declared type. The usage of this function in the main code (Line 139) warrants further inspection, specifically relating it back to the case sensitivity observed in the `Place` and `DC` structures. Examining bug records or past conversations for clues about case conversion differences is the next step.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"view_file","args":{"AbsolutePath":"\"e:\\\\Work\\\\Place_Migrate\\\\cci-dc-web\\\\04_critical_change\\\\TC-DC-FUNC-003-fix-apiclient-pascalcase-va-docker-config.md\"","EndLine":"60","StartLine":"1","toolAction":"\"View TC-DC-FUNC-003 in dc-web\"","toolSummary":"\"Read TC-DC-FUNC-003 in dc-web\""}}]}
{"step_index":5321,"source":"MODEL","type":"VIEW_FILE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-06T08:54:53Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-06T15:54:53+07:00\nCompleted At: 2026-10-06T15:54:53+07:00\nFile Path: `file:///e:/Work/Place_Migrate/cci-dc-web/04_critical_change/TC-DC-FUNC-003-fix-apiclient-pascalcase-va-docker-config.md`\nTotal Lines: 45\nTotal Bytes: 3400\nShowing lines 1 to 45\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1: # Hồ sơ Bug: TC-DC-FUNC-003 — Bảo Toàn PascalCase/Content-Length Cho APIClient và Bổ Sung Cấu Hình Docker Server\r\n2: \r\n3: > **Mã Bug**: `TC-DC-FUNC-003-fix-apiclient-pascalcase-va-docker-config`  \r\n4: > **Phạm vi**: `02_target/CoC.Web.DC/Helpers/APIClient.cs`, `02_target/CoC.Web.DC/Helpers/ApiHelper.cs`, `02_target/Dockerfile`, `02_target/CoC.Web.DC/appsettings.json`, `.gitignore`  \r\n5: > **Loại lỗi**: Functional / Serialization / Infrastructure Deployment  \r\n6: > **Môi trường bị ảnh hưởng**: Local Kestrel (.NET 10), Staging10 (MSSQL), Staging (PostgreSQL)  \r\n7: \r\n8: ---\r\n9: \r\n10: ## 1. Triệu chứng & Vấn đề\r\n11: \r\n12: 1. **Lỗi `503 Service Temporarily Unavailable` khi deploy lên server (`https://dc-stg10.concung.vn/`):**\r\n13:    - File `02_target/CoC.Web.DC/cci.core.json` bị chặn trong `.gitignore`, không được đóng gói vào Docker image.\r\n14:    - `Program.cs` cấu hình `config.AddJsonFile(\"cci.core.json\", optional: false)` nên khi pod khởi động, ứng dụng ném lỗi `FileNotFoundException` và crash ngay lập tức (CrashLoopBackOff).\r\n15: 2. **Lỗi serialization khi gọi Backend API (`dc-api-stg4.concung.vn`):**\r\n16:    - Trong `APIClient.cs`, `PostAsJsonAsync` và `PutAsJsonAsync` của .NET 10 mặc định dùng `JsonSerializerDefaults.Web`, ép toàn bộ tên thuộc tính C# sang `camelCase` làm Backend API (.NET Framework 4.8 WebApi 2) không map được model.\r\n17:    - `PostObject(string EndPoint, object Obj)` serialize theo ki\n<truncated 70 bytes>\nng.\r\n18:    - `PostAsJsonAsync` stream body dạng chunked không kèm `Content-Length`, làm IIS WebApi backend có `ServerCompressionHandler` trả về lỗi HTTP 500.\r\n19: \r\n20: ---\r\n21: \r\n22: ## 2. Giải pháp kỹ thuật\r\n23: \r\n24: 1. **Bỏ chặn và commit `cci.core.json` vào Git:**\r\n25:    - Xoá rule chặn trong `.gitignore` để file `02_target/CoC.Web.DC/cci.core.json` được đưa vào Docker image khi build trên Jenkins.\r\n26: 2. **Cấu hình Dual Port trong `Dockerfile`:**\r\n27:    - Cập nhật `EXPOSE 5311 5002` và `ENV ASPNETCORE_URLS=http://+:5311;http://+:5002` để tiếp nhận kết nối dù Kubernetes Service định tuyến vào cổng nào.\r\n28: 3. **Cấu hình `ClientUrl` chuẩn trong `appsettings.json`:**\r\n29:    - Cập nhật `\"ClientUrl\": \"https://dc-stg10.concung.vn/\"` cho môi trường deploy.\r\n30: 4. **Sửa `APIClient.cs` & `ApiHelper.cs`:**\r\n31:    - Thêm `_jsonOptions` với `PropertyNamingPolicy = null` để giữ nguyên PascalCase.\r\n32:    - Xác định runtime type: `var type = Obj?.GetType() ?? typeof(T)` để không bị payload rỗng `{}`.\r\n33:    - Dùng `StringContent(json, Encoding.UTF8, \"application/json\")` để bảo đảm luôn có header `Content-Length`.\r\n34:    - Trong `ApiHelper.cs`, đổi `_ObjAPIClient.PostObject(...)` sang generic `_ObjAPIClient.Post<T2>(...)`.\r\n35: \r\n36: ---\r\n37: \r\n38: ## 3. Kết quả kiểm chứng\r\n39: \r\n40: | Môi trường | Trước fix | Sau fix | Trạng thái |\r\n41: | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\r\n42: | **Local (.NET 10)** | POST/PUT ra body `{}` hoặc camelCase | Test E2E Playwright: **10 passed, 1 skipped** | ✅ Đạt |\r\n43: | **Staging10 (`dc-stg10`)** | 503 Service Temporarily Unavailable | Test E2E Playwright trên `dc-stg10`: **11 passed, 1 skipped, 0 failed** (20.8s) | ✅ Đạt |\r\n44: | **Staging (`dc-stg`)** | 503 Service Temporarily Unavailable | Chờ build Jenkins sau khi merge commit | ⏳ Chờ build |\r\n45: \nThe above content shows the entire, complete file contents of the requested file.\n","truncated_fields":["content"]}
{"step_index":5322,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-06T08:54:54Z","thinking":"The .NET 10 `PostAsJsonAsync` and `PutAsJsonAsync` methods, by default, serialize C# property names to camelCase using `JsonSerializerDefaults.Web`, which is incompatible with the older .NET Framework 4.8 WebApi 2 backend. This causes model mapping issues. The `PostObject` method uses static `object` serialization, which contributes to the problem.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"grep_search","args":{"CaseInsensitive":"true","MatchPerLine":"true","Query":"\"PostAsJsonAsync\"","SearchPath":"\"e:\\\\Work\\\\Place_Migrate\\\\cci-scm-web\"","toolAction":"\"Search PostAsJsonAsync in SCM\"","toolSummary":"\"Search PostAsJsonAsync in SCM\""}}]}
