{"step_index":6158,"source":"MODEL","type":"VIEW_FILE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-07T04:28:59Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-07T11:28:59+07:00\nCompleted At: 2026-10-07T11:28:59+07:00\nFile Path: `file:///e:/Work/Place_Migrate/cci-dc-web/02_target/Makefile`\nTotal Lines: 115\nTotal Bytes: 4796\nShowing lines 1 to 15\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1: .PHONY: help kill-port build run clean restore watch start dev verify test setup\n2: \n3: # ---- Cross-platform shell (pin Git Bash on Windows) ----\n4: ifeq ($(OS),Windows_NT)\n5: PROGFILES := $(if $(ProgramW6432),$(ProgramW6432),$(ProgramFiles))\n6: DEFAULT_GIT := $(subst \\,/,$(PROGFILES))/Git\n7: GIT_CANDIDATES := $(DEFAULT_GIT) E:/Download/Git D:/Download/Git C:/Download/Git E:/Git D:/Git C:/Git $(subst \\,/,$(LOCALAPPDATA))/Programs/Git\n8: GIT_ROOT  := $(firstword $(foreach d,$(GIT_CANDIDATES),$(if $(wildcard $(d)/usr/bin/bash.exe),$(d),)))\n9: ifeq ($(strip $(GIT_ROOT)),)\n10: GIT_ROOT  := $(DEFAULT_GIT)\n11: endif\n12: GIT_BASH  ?= $(GIT_ROOT)/usr/bin/bash.exe\n13: SHELL     := $(GIT_BASH)\n14: .SHELLFLAGS := -c\n15: export PATH := $(GIT_ROOT)/usr/bin;$(GIT_ROOT)/mingw64/bin;$(PATH)\nThe above content does NOT show the entire file contents. If you need to view any lines of the file which were not shown to complete your task, call this tool again to view those lines.\n"}
