no auto-search / keyword miss / keyword hit / page 2 / breadcrumb+grid). Generator:\r\n<truncated 495 bytes>\nPlace-parity)\r\n36: node scripts/resolve-scm-connection.cjs   # DB: cci-scm-api/app.config → 192.168.13.136/SCM\r\n37: ```\r\n38: \r\n39: Chi tiết: `fixtures/anchors/README.md`.\r\n40: \r\n41: ## Chạy\r\n42: \r\n43: ```bash\r\n44: npm install && npx playwright install chromium     # lần đầu\r\n45: cp .env.example .env                               # điền TEST_USERNAME/TEST_PASSWORD\r\n46: make -f Makefile.windows test-net4                 # NET4 — mốc chuẩn\r\n47: make -f Makefile.windows test_e2e_net10_mssql      # NET10 (URL theo .env; localhost → tự dựng)\r\n48: make -f Makefile.windows test-browser SPEC=e2e/<màn>/<màn>.e2e.spec.ts   # mở trình duyệt\r\n49: make -f Makefile.windows qa-verify-web             # typecheck + oracle-lock --check\r\n50: make -C ../.report dev                             # dashboard http://localhost:8932\r\n51: ```\r\n52: \r\n53: ## Không làm\r\n54: \r\n55: - Không sửa `01_origin/`, `02_target/` từ luồng QA.\r\n56: - Không ghi dữ liệu thật trừ khi `TEST_ALLOW_WRITE=1` (Place-parity trên stg).\r\n57: - Không commit `.env`, `.auth/`, `reports/details/`, `test-results/`, `allure-*`.\r\n58: \r\n59: ## Coverage (2026-10-08)\r\n60: \r\n61: - Index/full + form/detail + **Index-deep All (283 màn × TC-009..013)**: ~**395** specs dưới `e2e/`.\r\n62: - Oracle NET4: `https://scm-stg4.concung.vn/` · NET10 MSSQL: `https://scm-stg10.concung.vn/`.\r\n63: - DB staging: sibling `cci-scm-api/app.config` `ConnectionString` (`192.168.13.136`/`SCM`).\r\n64: - `TEST_ALLOW_WRITE=1` trên stg cho Save form / mutation Index.\r\n65: \r\n66: ## QA toolkit (port từ mbm-web `qa-regen-tooling`, 2026-10-08)\r\n67: \r\n68: - Guide: `docs/qa-toolkit/QA-TOOLKIT-WEB.md` (N1–N15)\r\n69: - Viewer `.report`: `scBucket()` + filter \"Chỉ lỗi thật\" + đếm lỗi/thiếu data\r\n70: - `python scripts/report-observed.py` (N6 observed vs assumed)\r\n71: - Commands: `.opencode/c