{"step_index":6498,"source":"MODEL","type":"VIEW_FILE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-08T07:52:49Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-08T14:52:49+07:00\nCompleted At: 2026-10-08T14:52:49+07:00\nFile Path: `file:///e:/Work/Place_Migrate/cci-scm-web/03_qa/Makefile.windows`\nTotal Lines: 117\nTotal Bytes: 6632\nShowing lines 1 to 100\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1: # Makefile.win — Windows version of ./Makefile.\r\n2: # Requires GNU Make for Windows (choco install make) and PowerShell on PATH.\r\n3: # Uses default cmd.exe shell for recipes; heavy orchestration lives in\r\n4: # scripts/*.win.ps1 (start-env, stop-env, run-e2e) since multi-line PowerShell\r\n5: # recipes under GNU Make's Windows port are unreliable.\r\n6: #\r\n7: # Usage: make -f Makefile.win <target>\r\n8: # (or copy/rename to Makefile to make it the default on a Windows-only checkout)\r\n9: \r\n10: # Pin cmd.exe bất kể SHELL kế thừa từ ngoài (vd Git Bash export SHELL=/bin/bash.exe khiến\r\n11: # GNU Make chạy recipe qua bash — bash nuốt backslash trong path Windows, `scripts\\x.ps1`\r\n12: # thành `scriptsx.ps1`, làm powershell -File báo \"argument does not exist\").\r\n13: SHELL := cmd.exe\r\n14: .SHELLFLAGS := /D /S /C\r\n15: \r\n16: .PHONY: install typecheck test test-local test-net4 test-browser test_e2e_net4 test_e2e_net10_mssql test_e2e_net10_postgresql start-api start-web start-all stop-api stop-web stop-all kill-ports test-report smoke clean status qa-verify-web\r\n17: \r\n18: APP_ENV ?= LOCAL\r\n19: \r\n20: # UAT E2E — chạy trực tiếp trên server UAT (không start local API/web).\r\n21: # Override URL tại runtime: make -f Makefile.win test-net4 NET4_BASE_URL=https://scm-stg4.concung.vn/\r\n22: # Không truyền -> run-e2e.win.ps1 tự đọc NET4_MSSQL_BASE_URL từ .env (cùng tên biến với s