gin dev\r\n531: \r\n532: git branch -d fix/TC-DC01-021-sai-ma-loi-anonymous\r\n533: git push origin --delete fix/TC-DC01-021-sai-ma-loi-anonymous      # chỉ khi đã t\n<truncated 151 bytes>\no.\r\n539: \r\n540: ```bash\r\n541: SHA=$(git rev-parse dev^2)                           # commit fix (cha thứ hai của commit merge)\r\n542: git show --stat \"$SHA\"                               # phải có code/test và hồ sơ\r\n543: git tag -a fix/TC-DC01-021-sai-ma-loi-anonymous \"$SHA\" \\\r\n544:   -m \"ref: 04_critical_change/test-net10-mssql-report-20260927-133204/TC-DC01-021-sai-ma-loi-anonymous.md\" \\\r\n545:   -m \"files: $(git diff-tree --no-commit-id --name-only -r \"$SHA\" | paste -sd, -)\"\r\n546: git push origin fix/TC-DC01-021-sai-ma-loi-anonymous\r\n547: ```\r\n548: \r\n549: Script migrate lại đọc hai dòng `ref:` và `files:`; không đổi định dạng này. Nội dung tag sau khi gắn trông như sau:\r\n550: \r\n551: ```text\r\n552: ref: 04_critical_change/test-net10-mssql-report-20260927-133204/TC-DC01-021-sai-ma-loi-anonymous.md\r\n553: \r\n554: files: 02_target/net10_mssql/CoC.API.DC/Controllers/SupplierOrdersController.cs,04_critical_change/test-net10-mssql-report-20260927-133204/TC-DC01-021-sai-ma-loi-anonymous.md\r\n555: ```\r\n556: \r\n557: ### A7. Merge dev vào staging\r\n558: \r\n559: ```bash\r\n560: git switch dev && git pull --ff-only origin dev\r\n561: \r\n562: git fetch origin staging10\r\n563: git switch -C staging10 FETCH_HEAD\r\n564: git merge --no-edit dev                              # conflict: xem mục 6.7\r\n565: git push origin staging10\r\n566: \r\n567: git fetch origin staging\r\n568: git switch -C staging FETCH_HEAD\r\n569: git merge --no-edit dev\r\n570: git push origin staging\r\n571: \r\n572: git switch dev\r\n573: ```\r\n574: \r\n575: Conflict ở file cấu hình: `git checkout --ours <file>`, `git add <file>`, `git commit --no-edit`. Conflict ở file code: `git merge --abort` rồi hỏi lead.\r\n576: \r\n577: ### A8. Kiểm tra staging đã có fix\r\n578: \r