{"step_index":7928,"source":"MODEL","type":"VIEW_FILE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-09T04:40:38Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-09T11:40:38+07:00\nCompleted At: 2026-10-09T11:40:38+07:00\nFile Path: `file:///e:/Work/Place_Migrate/cci-scm-web/03_qa/.env.example`\nTotal Lines: 49\nTotal Bytes: 2439\nShowing lines 1 to 49\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1: # scm-web — Playwright E2E env (copy thành .env — .env nằm trong .gitignore)\n2: #\n3: # playwright.config.ts gọi dotenv config() ngay đầu file — mọi biến ở đây tự nạp vào process.env\n4: # cho cả Makefile (bash) lẫn Makefile.windows/run-e2e.win.ps1.\n5: # Sinh bởi skill qa-web-bootstrap (thông số gốc ở 03_qa/qa-app.json).\n6: \n7: # URL đích test theo môi trường — cùng tên biến với repo -api (NET4_MSSQL_* / NET10_*).\n8: #   make test-net4                  -> NET4_MSSQL_BASE_URL (luôn remote, không start local) — MỐC CHUẨN\n9: #   make test_e2e_net10_mssql       -> NET10_MSSQL_BASE_URL\n10: #   make test_e2e_net10_postgresql  -> NET10_POSTGRESQL_BASE_URL\n11: # Với 2 biến NET10: rỗng hoặc trỏ localhost -> tự build+start API+WEB trên máy (web :5316 — cổng\n12: # Keycloak redirect về), test xong tự tắt; URL remote -> test thẳng, không start gì.\n13: NET4_MSSQL_BASE_URL=https://scm-stg4.concung.vn/\n14: NET10_MSSQL_BASE_URL=https://scm-stg10.concung.vn/\n15: NET10_POSTGRESQL_BASE_URL=https://scm-stg.concung.vn/\n16: \n17: # SSO (Keycloak ids1-stg) — tài khoản test chính, cần đủ quyền các màn của app.\n18: TEST_USERNAME=\n19: TEST_PASSWORD=\n20: \n21: # Tài khoản phụ (peer) — cho test cần 2 tài khoản. Rỗng thì test peer-gated tự skip.\n22: TEST_USERNAME_PEER=\n23: TEST_PASSWORD_PEER=\n24: \n25: # Ghi STG (Save form / mutation Index) — Place-parity. Chỉ bật trên stg khi cố ý.\n26: TEST_ALLOW_WRITE=1\n27: \n28: # Edit seed IDs — harvest từ stg4: npm run harvest:seeds-ui && npm run anchors:promote\n29: # DB staging: node scripts/resolve-scm-connection.cjs (đọc cci-scm-api/app.config)\n30: # SCM_CONNECTION_STRING=\n31: \n32: # ── Upload report JSON lên GCS + ghi ReportTest.test_report ──\n33: # Chạy sau mỗi `make test-*` qua scripts/upload-report.js (tắt: UPLOAD_REPORT=0).\n34: # Bearer = .auth/token.json (setup ghi kèm SSO). Pass có `#` phải bọc nháy đơn.\n35: TESTREPORTER_DB_HOST=192.168.13.223\n36: TESTREPORTER_DB_NAME=ReportTest\n37: TESTREPORTER_DB_USER=\n38: TESTREPORTER_DB_PASSWORD=\n39: TESTREPORTER_PROJECT=17_SCM\n40: TESTREPORTER_PLATFORM=web\n41: #TESTREPORTER_GCS_API=https://wap-gcs-api-stg.concung.vn/api/gcs/public/getpresignedlink\n42: #TESTREPORTER_GCS_MODULE=none\n43: \n44: # IDS1 — implicit token cho GCS presign (cùng account TEST_USERNAME)\n45: IDS1_URL=https://ids1-stg.concung.vn/realms/master\n46: IDS1_CLIENT_ID=CCI.Swagger.ClientCredential\n47: IDS1_SCOPE=CCI.Swagger\n48: IDS1_REDIRECT_URI=http://localhost:5575/swagger/oauth2-redirect.html\n49: \nThe above content shows the entire, complete file contents of the requested file.\n"}
