ời dùng truy cập `/Error/Unauthorized`, `MvcAuthorizeAttribute` không\n<truncated 2977 bytes>","Description":"\"Critical change documentation for TC-SCM-ERR-001\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"e:/Work/Place_Migrate/cci-scm-web/04_critical_change/test-report-20261009-101723/TC-SCM-ERR-001-error-unauthorized-http-500.md\"","toolAction":"\"Writing critical change doc\"","toolSummary":"\"Create critical change doc for TC-SCM-ERR-001\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
