{"step_index":8086,"source":"MODEL","type":"VIEW_FILE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-09T04:50:55Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-09T11:50:55+07:00\nCompleted At: 2026-10-09T11:50:55+07:00\nFile Path: `file:///e:/Work/Place_Migrate/cci-scm-web/03_qa/Makefile.windows`\nTotal Lines: 131\nTotal Bytes: 7716\nShowing lines 70 to 110\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n70: \n71: # Chạy toàn bộ e2e suite với browser THẬT (headed) để quan sát trực tiếp.\n72: # Vd: make -f Makefile.win test-browser SPEC=e2e/login/login.e2e.spec.ts\n73: #     make -f Makefile.win test-browser GREP=TC-SCM-19\n74: #     make -f Makefile.win test-browser SLOWMO=800\n75: test-browser:\n76: \tpowershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File scripts\\run-e2e.win.ps1 -Variant mssql -Project e2e -Headed -Workers 1 -SlowMo \"$(SLOWMO)\" -Spec \"$(SPEC)\" -Grep \"$(GREP)\"\n77: \n78: # Kill process đang chiếm port API + web trước khi start.\n79: kill-ports:\n80: \tpowershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File scripts\\kill-ports.win.ps1 $(API_PORT) $(WEB_PORT)\n81: \n82: # Build + start scm-api + scm-web (net10_mssql) trực tiếp, không tự stop, không chạy test.\n83: start-api:\n84: \tpowershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File scripts\\start-env.win.ps1 -Variant mssql\n85: \n86: start-web: start-api\n87: \n88: stop-api:\n89: \tpowershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File scripts\\stop-env.win.ps1\n90: \n91: stop-web: stop-api\n92: \n93: stop-all: stop-api\n94: start-all: start-api\n95: \n96: # Chạy test (net10_mssql) + sinh HTML report + fail-list.\n97: # Luôn sinh report kể cả khi test fail (đó chính là lúc report cần nhất) — không dùng test-local\n98: # làm prerequisite (make dừng ngay khi nó lỗi, bỏ qua generate-report.js luôn). `&` (không phải\n99: # `&&`) chạy lệnh sau bất kể errorlevel; lưu errorlevel vào ST rồi exit /b %ST% để giữ đúng mã lỗi\n100: # test cho CI, giống pattern `status=$$?; ...; exit $$status` của Makefile (bash) song song.\n101: test-report:\n102: \t@$(MAKE) -f Makefile.windows -s test-local & set \"ST=%ERRORLEVEL%\" & node scripts\\generate-report.js reports/details/test-mssql-report-latest.json --no-open & exit /b %ST%\n103: \n104: # Đẩy report JSON mới nhất lên GCS + ReportTest (cũng tự chạy cuối run-e2e.win.ps1).\n105: #   make -f Makefile.windows upload-report PREFIX=test-net4\n106: #   make -f Makefile.windows upload-report ARGS=reports/details/<file>.json\n107: upload-report:\n108: \t@node --use-system-ca scripts\\upload-report.js $(if $(PREFIX),--prefix $(PREFIX),$(ARGS))\n109: \n110: clean: kill-ports\nThe above content does NOT show the entire file contents. If you need to view any lines of the file which were not shown to complete your task, call this tool again to view those lines.\n"}
{"step_index":8088,"source":"MODEL","type":"VIEW_FILE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-09T04:50:58Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-09T11:50:58+07:00\nCompleted At: 2026-10-09T11:50:58+07:00\nFile Path: `file:///e:/Work/Place_Migrate/cci-scm-web/03_qa/Makefile.windows`\nTotal Lines: 131\nTotal Bytes: 7716\nShowing lines 1 to 70\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1: # Makefile.win — Windows version of ./Makefile.\n2: # Requires GNU Make for Windows (choco install make) and PowerShell on PATH.\n3: # Uses default cmd.exe shell for recipes; heavy orchestration lives in\n4: # scripts/*.win.ps1 (start-env, stop-env, run-e2e) since multi-line PowerShell\n5: # recipes under GNU Make's Windows port are unreliable.\n6: #\n7: # Usage: make -f Makefile.win <target>\n8: # (or copy/rename to Makefile to make it the default on a Windows-only checkout)\n9: \n10: # Pin cmd.exe bất kể SHELL kế thừa từ ngoài (vd Git Bash export SHELL=/bin/bash.exe khiến\n11: # GNU Make chạy recipe qua bash — bash nuốt backslash trong path Windows, `scripts\\x.ps1`\n12: # thành `scriptsx.ps1`, làm powershell -File báo \"argument does not exist\").\n13: SHELL := cmd.exe\n14: .SHELLFLAGS := /D /S /C\n15: \n16: .PHONY: install typecheck test test-local test-net4 test-browser test_e2e_net4 test_e2e_net10_mssql test_e2e_net10_postgresql start-api start-web start-all stop-api stop-web stop-all kill-ports test-report upload-report smoke clean status qa-verify-web\n17: \n18: APP_ENV ?= LOCAL\n19: \n20: # UAT E2E — chạy trực tiếp trên server UAT (không start local API/web).\n21: # Override URL tại runtime: make -f Makefile.win test-net4 NET4_BASE_URL=https://scm-stg4.concung.vn/\n22: # Không truyền -> run-e2e.win.ps1 tự đọc NET4_MSSQL_BASE_URL từ .env (cùng tên biến với scm-api).\n23: # Credentials KHÔNG hardcode ở đây — playwright.config.ts's dotenv.config() tự nạp\n24: # TEST_USERNAME/TEST_PASSWORD từ .env, không phụ thuộc s\n<truncated 1107 bytes>\nconcung.vn/ SPEC=e2e/login/login.e2e.spec.ts\n51: #     make -f Makefile.win test-net4 NET4_BASE_URL=https://scm-stg4.concung.vn/ GREP=TC-SCM-19\n52: test-net4:\n53: \tpowershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File scripts\\run-e2e.win.ps1 -Variant none -Project e2e -BaseUrl \"$(NET4_BASE_URL)\" -Workers \"$(WORKERS)\" -Spec \"$(SPEC)\" -Grep \"$(GREP)\" -ReportPrefix test-net4 & $(MAKE) -f Makefile.windows -s upload-report PREFIX=test-net4 & exit /b 0\n54: \n55: # ── Canonical E2E entrypoints ──\n56: test_e2e_net4: test-net4\n57: \n58: # -Variant auto: URL đích lấy từ .env (NET10_MSSQL_BASE_URL / NET10_POSTGRESQL_BASE_URL — cùng tên\n59: # với scm-api/03_qa/.env). Rỗng hoặc localhost -> tự build+start API+WEB trên máy (:5316) rồi tắt;\n60: # URL remote (vd https://scm-stg10.concung.vn/) -> test thẳng. Đổi đích: sửa .env, lệnh giữ nguyên.\n61: test_e2e_net10_mssql:\n62: \tpowershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File scripts\\run-e2e.win.ps1 -Variant auto -UrlVar NET10_MSSQL_BASE_URL -LocalVariant mssql -Project e2e -Workers \"$(WORKERS)\" -Spec \"$(SPEC)\" -Grep \"$(GREP)\" -ReportPrefix test-mssql & $(MAKE) -f Makefile.windows -s upload-report PREFIX=test-mssql & exit /b 0\n63: \n64: test_e2e_net10_postgresql:\n65: \tpowershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File scripts\\run-e2e.win.ps1 -Variant auto -UrlVar NET10_POSTGRESQL_BASE_URL -LocalVariant pgsql -Project e2e -Workers \"$(WORKERS)\" -Spec \"$(SPEC)\" -Grep \"$(GREP)\" -ReportPrefix test-pgsql & $(MAKE) -f Makefile.windows -s upload-report PREFIX=test-pgsql & exit /b 0\n66: \n67: # Smoke: mở browser THẬT (headed) trên spec home để verify visual nhanh.\n68: smoke:\n69: \tpowershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File scripts\\run-e2e.win.ps1 -Variant mssql -Project e2e-local -Headed -Workers 1 -Spec e2e/home/home.e2e.spec.ts -Grep \"smoke:\"\n70: \nThe above content does NOT show the entire file contents. If you need to view any lines of the file which were not shown to complete your task, call this tool again to view those lines.\n","truncated_fields":["content"]}
