{"step_index":8232,"source":"MODEL","type":"VIEW_FILE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-09T04:58:34Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-09T11:58:34+07:00\nCompleted At: 2026-10-09T11:58:34+07:00\nFile Path: `file:///e:/Work/Place_Migrate/cci-dc-web/03_qa/Makefile`\nTotal Lines: 214\nTotal Bytes: 13510\nShowing lines 120 to 175\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n120: \t\tnpx playwright test --project=e2e $(if $(WORKERS),--workers=$(WORKERS),) $(SPEC) $(if $(GREP),-g \"$(GREP)\",)\n121: endif\n122: \n123: test_e2e_net10_postgresql:\n124: ifeq ($(call is_local,$(NET10_POSTGRESQL_BASE_URL)),1)\n125: \tVARIANT=pgsql ./scripts/start-env.sh && LOCAL_BASE_URL=http://localhost:5311 BASE_URL=http://localhost:5311 REPORT_PREFIX=test-pgsql \\\n126: \t\tnpx playwright test --project=e2e $(if $(WORKERS),--workers=$(WORKERS),) $(SPEC) $(if $(GREP),-g \"$(GREP)\",); status=$$?; ./scripts/stop-env.sh; exit $$status\n127: else\n128: \tLOCAL_BASE_URL=$(NET10_POSTGRESQL_BASE_URL) BASE_URL=$(NET10_POSTGRESQL_BASE_URL) REPORT_PREFIX=test-pgsql \\\n129: \t\tnpx playwright test --project=e2e $(if $(WORKERS),--workers=$(WORKERS),) $(SPEC) $(if $(GREP),-g \"$(GREP)\",)\n130: endif\n131: \n132: # Smoke: mở browser THẬT (headed, không headless) trên 1 spec (home) để verify visual nhanh.\n133: # --workers=1 để chạy tuần tự, dễ quan sát trên màn hình.\n134: smoke:\n135: \t./scripts/start-env.sh && npx playwright test --project=e2e-local --headed --workers=1 e2e/home/home.e2e.spec.ts -g \"smoke:\"; status=$$?; ./scripts/stop-env.sh; exit $$status\n136: \n137: # Chạy toàn bộ e2e suite với browser THẬT (headed, không headless) để quan sát trực tiếp.\n138: # --workers=1 để chạy tuần tự (dễ theo dõi từng bước); dùng SPEC=<path> hoặc GREP=<pattern> để giới hạn phạm vi, vd:\n139: #   make test-browser SPEC=e2e/login/login.e2e.spec.ts\n140: #   make test-browser GREP=\"TC-DC-19\"\n141: #   make test-browser SLOWMO=800   # thêm 800ms gi\n<truncated 346 bytes>\n --project=e2e\n148: \n149: # Kill process đang chiếm port API + web trước khi start.\n150: kill-ports:\n151: \t@for port in $(API_PORT) $(WEB_PORT); do \\\n152: \t\tpid=$$(lsof -ti:$$port -sTCP:LISTEN 2>/dev/null); \\\n153: \t\tif [ -n \"$$pid\" ]; then kill -9 $$pid 2>/dev/null; echo \"Killed process on port $$port\"; fi; \\\n154: \tdone\n155: \n156: # Build + start dc-api (net10_mssql, port 5114) + chờ health (swagger.json = 200-499).\n157: start-api: kill-ports\n158: \t@echo \"Building $(API_CSPROJ)...\"\n159: \t@ok=0; for i in 1 2 3; do dotnet build \"$(API_CSPROJ)\" -v:q && { ok=1; break; }; echo \"retry $$i/3...\"; sleep 3; done; [ $$ok = 1 ] || { echo \"❌ API build failed\"; exit 1; }\n160: \t@echo \"Starting API on port $(API_PORT)...\"\n161: \t@(cd $(API_DIR) && ASPNETCORE_URLS=http://0.0.0.0:$(API_PORT) ASPNETCORE_ENVIRONMENT=Development \\\n162: \t\tnohup dotnet run --no-launch-profile > $(API_LOG) 2>&1 < /dev/null & echo $$! > $(API_PID))\n163: \t@echo \"Waiting for API (port $(API_PORT))...\"\n164: \t@for i in $$(seq 1 180); do \\\n165: \t\tstatus=$$(curl -s -o /dev/null -w \"%{http_code}\" --max-time 3 http://localhost:$(API_PORT)/swagger/v1/swagger.json 2>/dev/null); \\\n166: \t\tif [ \"$$status\" -ge 200 ] && [ \"$$status\" -lt 500 ]; then echo \"✅ API ready (HTTP $$status)\"; exit 0; fi; \\\n167: \t\tsleep 2; \\\n168: \tdone; \\\n169: \techo \"❌ API failed to start within 360s (log: $(API_LOG))\"; tail -30 $(API_LOG); exit 1\n170: \n171: # Build + start web app (net10_mssql, port 5311) + chờ health (200-499 = pass, auth-gated trả 302).\n172: # Retry 3 lần — MSB3492 (cache obj/ bị IDE design-time build chạm race) là transient.\n173: start-web: kill-ports\n174: \t@echo \"Building $(WEB_CSPROJ)...\"\n175: \t@ok=0; for i in 1 2 3; do dotnet build \"$(WEB_CSPROJ)\" -v:q && { ok=1; break; }; echo \"retry $$i/3...\"; sleep 3; done; [ $$ok = 1 ] || { echo \"❌ Build failed\"; exit 1; }\nThe above content does NOT show the entire file contents. If you need to view any lines of the file which were not shown to complete your task, call this tool again to view those lines.\n","truncated_fields":["content"]}
