{"step_index":8280,"source":"MODEL","type":"VIEW_FILE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-09T05:01:57Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-09T12:01:57+07:00\nCompleted At: 2026-10-09T12:01:57+07:00\nFile Path: `file:///e:/Work/Place_Migrate/cci-store-location-web/03_qa/Makefile.windows`\nTotal Lines: 117\nTotal Bytes: 6758\nShowing lines 50 to 117\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n50: #     make -f Makefile.win test-net4 NET4_BASE_URL=https://place-stg4.concung.vn/ SPEC=e2e/login/login.e2e.spec.ts\r\n51: #     make -f Makefile.win test-net4 NET4_BASE_URL=https://place-stg4.concung.vn/ GREP=TC-PLACE-19\r\n52: test-net4:\r\n53: \tpowershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File scripts\\run-e2e.win.ps1 -Variant none -Project e2e -BaseUrl \"$(NET4_BASE_URL)\" -Workers \"$(WORKERS)\" -Spec \"$(SPEC)\" -Grep \"$(GREP)\" -ReportPrefix test-net4\r\n54: \r\n55: # ── Canonical E2E entrypoints ──\r\n56: test_e2e_net4: test-net4\r\n57: \r\n58: # -Variant auto: URL đích lấy từ .env (NET10_MSSQL_BASE_URL / NET10_POSTGRESQL_BASE_URL — cùng tên\r\n59: # với store-location-api/03_qa/.env). Rỗng hoặc localhost -> tự build+start API+WEB trên máy (:5305) rồi tắt;\r\n60: # URL remote (vd https://place-stg10.concung.vn/) -> test thẳng. Đổi đích: sửa .env, lệnh giữ nguyên.\r\n61: test_e2e_net10_mssql:\r\n62: \tpowershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File scripts\\run-e2e.win.ps1 -Variant auto -UrlVar NET10_MSSQL_BASE_URL -LocalVariant mssql -Project e2e -Workers \"$(WORKERS)\" -Spec \"$(SPEC)\" -Grep \"$(GREP)\" -ReportPrefix test-mssql\r\n63: \r\n64: test_e2e_net10_postgresql:\r\n65: \tpowershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File scripts\\run-e2e.win.ps1 -Variant auto -UrlVar NET10_POSTGRESQL_BASE_URL -LocalVariant pgsql -Project e2e -Workers \"$(WORKERS)\" -Spec \"$(SPEC)\" -Grep \"$(GREP)\" -ReportPrefix test-pgsql\r\n66: \r\n67: # Smoke: mở browser THẬT (headed) trên spec home để verify visual nhanh.\r\n68: smoke:\r\n69: \tpowershell -NoProfi\n<truncated 1116 bytes>\nstart-web: start-api\r\n87: \r\n88: stop-api:\r\n89: \tpowershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File scripts\\stop-env.win.ps1\r\n90: \r\n91: stop-web: stop-api\r\n92: \r\n93: stop-all: stop-api\r\n94: start-all: start-api\r\n95: \r\n96: # Chạy test (net10_mssql) + sinh HTML report + fail-list.\r\n97: # Luôn sinh report kể cả khi test fail (đó chính là lúc report cần nhất) — không dùng test-local\r\n98: # làm prerequisite (make dừng ngay khi nó lỗi, bỏ qua generate-report.js luôn). `&` (không phải\r\n99: # `&&`) chạy lệnh sau bất kể errorlevel; lưu errorlevel vào ST rồi exit /b %ST% để giữ đúng mã lỗi\r\n100: # test cho CI, giống pattern `status=$$?; ...; exit $$status` của Makefile (bash) song song.\r\n101: test-report:\r\n102: \t@$(MAKE) -f Makefile.windows -s test-local & set \"ST=%ERRORLEVEL%\" & node scripts\\generate-report.js reports/details/test-mssql-report-latest.json --no-open & exit /b %ST%\r\n103: \r\n104: clean: kill-ports\r\n105: \t-powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -Command \"Remove-Item -Recurse -Force allure-results,allure-report,node_modules,test-results -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue\"\r\n106: \r\n107: status:\r\n108: \t@echo APP_ENV=$(APP_ENV) API_PORT=$(API_PORT) WEB_PORT=$(WEB_PORT)\r\n109: \r\n110: # 2 gate THUẦN MAKE, KHÔNG LLM — dùng cuối `qa-regen-web` (xem .opencode/command/qa-regen-web.md).\r\n111: # 1. typecheck spec TypeScript.  2. oracle-lock-screen --check: mọi blueprint 00_docs/00_screen/\r\n112: #    đã khớp Controller/AngularJS hiện tại (nếu FAIL nghĩa là qa-docs-web chưa chạy/chưa xong cho\r\n113: #    màn nào đó đã đổi source). Không chạy Playwright thật ở đây — đó là test-local/test-report,\r\n114: #    tách riêng vì cần app + API sống.\r\n115: qa-verify-web: typecheck\r\n116: \tpython ..\\scripts\\oracle-lock-screen.py --check\r\n117: \nThe above content does NOT show the entire file contents. If you need to view any lines of the file which were not shown to complete your task, call this tool again to view those lines.\n","truncated_fields":["content"]}
