{"step_index":8628,"source":"MODEL","type":"VIEW_FILE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-12T07:38:00Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-12T14:38:00+07:00\nCompleted At: 2026-10-12T14:38:00+07:00\nFile Path: `file:///E:/Work/Place_Migrate/cci-scm-web/03_qa/Makefile`\nTotal Lines: 220\nTotal Bytes: 14386\nShowing lines 101 to 160\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n101: #   make test-net4 NET4_BASE_URL=https://scm-stg4.concung.vn/ SPEC=e2e/login/login.e2e.spec.ts\n102: #   make test-net4 NET4_BASE_URL=https://scm-stg4.concung.vn/ GREP=\"TC-SCM-19\"\n103: test-net4:\n104: \tLOCAL_BASE_URL=$(NET4_BASE_URL) BASE_URL=$(NET4_BASE_URL) APP_ENV=NET4_MSSQL REPORT_PREFIX=test-net4 \\\n105: \t\tnpx playwright test --project=e2e $(if $(WORKERS),--workers=$(WORKERS),) $(SPEC) $(if $(GREP),-g \"$(GREP)\",); status=$$?; $(MAKE) -s upload-report PREFIX=test-net4 || true; exit $$status\n106: \n107: # ── Canonical E2E entrypoints ──\n108: # test_e2e_net4              → alias test-net4 (remote UAT, không start local)\n109: # test_e2e_net10_mssql      → NET10_MSSQL_BASE_URL: remote → test thẳng; rỗng/localhost → start API :5119 + WEB :5316 → e2e → stop\n110: # test_e2e_net10_postgresql  → NET10_POSTGRESQL_BASE_URL: remote → test thẳng; rỗng/localhost → start API :5219 + WEB :5316 → e2e → stop\n111: # Giới hạn phạm vi qua SPEC=<path> hoặc GREP=<pattern> (vd: make test_e2e_net10_mssql SPEC=e2e/login/login.e2e.spec.ts)\n112: test_e2e_net4: test-net4\n113: \n114: test_e2e_net10_mssql:\n115: ifeq ($(call is_local,$(NET10_MSSQL_BASE_URL)),1)\n116: \tVARIANT=mssql ./scripts/start-env.sh && LOCAL_BASE_URL=http://localhost:5316 BASE_URL=http://localhost:5316 APP_ENV=NET10_MSSQL REPORT_PREFIX=test-mssql \\\n117: \t\tnpx playwright test --project=e2e $(if $(WORKERS),--workers=$(WORKERS),) $(SPEC) $(if $(GREP),-g \"$(GREP)\",); status=$$?; $(MAKE) -s upload-report PREFIX=test-mssql || true; ./scripts/stop-env.sh; exit $$status\n118: else\n119: \tLO\n<truncated 1187 bytes>\nrowser THẬT (headed, không headless) trên 1 spec (home) để verify visual nhanh.\n133: # --workers=1 để chạy tuần tự, dễ quan sát trên màn hình.\n134: smoke:\n135: \t./scripts/start-env.sh && npx playwright test --project=e2e-local --headed --workers=1 e2e/home/home.e2e.spec.ts -g \"smoke:\"; status=$$?; ./scripts/stop-env.sh; exit $$status\n136: \n137: # Chạy toàn bộ e2e suite với browser THẬT (headed, không headless) để quan sát trực tiếp.\n138: # --workers=1 để chạy tuần tự (dễ theo dõi từng bước); dùng SPEC=<path> hoặc GREP=<pattern> để giới hạn phạm vi, vd:\n139: #   make test-browser SPEC=e2e/login/login.e2e.spec.ts\n140: #   make test-browser GREP=\"TC-SCM-19\"\n141: #   make test-browser SLOWMO=800   # thêm 800ms giữa mỗi action để nhìn rõ (mặc định 500ms)\n142: SLOWMO ?= 500\n143: test-browser:\n144: \t./scripts/start-env.sh && SLOWMO=$(SLOWMO) npx playwright test --project=e2e --headed --workers=1 $(SPEC) $(if $(GREP),-g \"$(GREP)\",); status=$$?; ./scripts/stop-env.sh; exit $$status\n145: \n146: _run-local:\n147: \tAPP_ENV=LOCAL npx playwright test --project=e2e\n148: \n149: # Kill process đang chiếm port API + web trước khi start.\n150: kill-ports:\n151: \t@for port in $(API_PORT) $(WEB_PORT); do \\\n152: \t\tpid=$$(lsof -ti:$$port -sTCP:LISTEN 2>/dev/null); \\\n153: \t\tif [ -n \"$$pid\" ]; then kill -9 $$pid 2>/dev/null; echo \"Killed process on port $$port\"; fi; \\\n154: \tdone\n155: \n156: # Build + start scm-api (net10_mssql, port 5119) + chờ health (swagger.json = 200-499).\n157: start-api: kill-ports\n158: \t@echo \"Building $(API_CSPROJ)...\"\n159: \t@ok=0; for i in 1 2 3; do dotnet build \"$(API_CSPROJ)\" -v:q && { ok=1; break; }; echo \"retry $$i/3...\"; sleep 3; done; [ $$ok = 1 ] || { echo \"❌ API build failed\"; exit 1; }\n160: \t@echo \"Starting API on port $(API_PORT)...\"\nThe above content does NOT show the entire file contents. If you need to view any lines of the file which were not shown to complete your task, call this tool again to view those lines.\n","truncated_fields":["content"]}
