itignore.\r\n24:       * Toan bo file nay la ASCII thuan (khong dau tieng Viet) => khong phu thuoc\r\n25:         encoding luc luu. File .ps1 co ky tu non-ASCII ma luu UTF-8 *khong BOM* se bi\r\n26:         Windows PowerShell 5.1 doc theo ANSI: 3 byte cua em-dash (E2 80 94) thanh 3 ky tu\r\n27:         cp1252, trong do 0x94 la RIGHT DOUBLE QUOTATION MARK - ma PS coi day la dau nhay\r\n28:         kep hop le => nuot luon than ham phia sau, bao 'X is not recognized'. Giu ASCII\r\n29:         thi khong bao gio dinh, du editor luu kieu gi.\r\n30: \r\n31: .PARAMETER Configuration\r\n32:     Debug (mac dinh) | Release | Sprint | Production. Khop 4 config trong .sln.\r\n33:     LUU Y: Web.{Configuration}.config la XDT transform, chi ap dung khi *publish*.\r\n34:     Chay bang IIS Express luon doc Web.config (ban da bom boi `make config`) - doi\r\n35:     -Configuration KHONG doi connection string / appSettings.\r\n36: \r\n37: .PARAMETER Port\r\n38:     Cong IIS Express. Bo trong thi lay <runPorts app=\"origin\"> trong app.config o root,\r\n39:     de origin chay song song voi cac ban target ma khong dam port.\r\n40:     <IISUrl> trong csproj KHONG anh huong: do chi la thiet lap cua Visual Studio F5,\r\n41:     `iisexpress /port:` bo qua no.\r\n42: \r\n43: .PARAMETER BuildOnly\r\n44:     Chi build, khong chay IIS Express.\r\n45: \r\n46: .PARAMETER NoBuild\r\n47:     Bo qua restore+build, chay thang IIS Express tren bin/ dang co.\r\n48: \r\n49: .PARAMETER Clean\r\n50:     Chay msbuild /t:Clean truoc khi build.\r\n51: \r\n52: .PARAMETER Use32Bit\r\n53:     Dung IIS Express 32-bit (Program Files (x86)) thay vi 64-bit. Ca hai deu chay duoc\r\n54:     (da kiem chung); csproj de <Use64BitIISExpress /> rong nen Visual Studio dung 32-bit.\r\n55: \r\n56: .PARAMETER KillPort\r\n57:     Kill iisexpress dang giu -Port truoc khi chay (xem ghi chu o Invoke-KillPort).\r\n58: \r\n59: .PARAMETER Verify\r\n60:     Build, chay IIS Express o nen, curl health endpoint, in PASS/FAIL roi tat.\r\nThe above content does NOT show the entire file contents. If you need to view any lines of the file which were not shown to complete your task, call this tool again to view those lines.\n"}
