{"step_index":9746,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-13T09:13:23Z","thinking":"Observed varying responses from different API endpoints.  One staging environment returned a server error, another failed to resolve the address, and the UAT environment returned an empty permissions object. The production endpoint provided a successful response, but with a significantly large data payload.  It is worth investigating why the production environment returns such a large permissions object compared to other environments.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"\"python -c \\\"\\nimport sys, urllib.request, urllib.parse, json, ssl\\nsys.stdout.reconfigure(encoding='utf-8')\\n\\nctx = ssl.create_default_context()\\nctx.check_hostname = False\\nctx.verify_mode = ssl.CERT_NONE\\n\\ntoken_url = 'https://ids1-stg.concung.vn/realms/master/protocol/openid-connect/token'\\ndata = urllib.parse.urlencode({\\n    'client_id': 'scm.ClientCredential',\\n    'client_secret': '6D9F85',\\n    'scope': 'scm-api',\\n    'grant_type': 'client_credentials'\\n}).encode('utf-8')\\n\\nreq = urllib.request.Request(token_url, data=data, method='POST')\\nwith urllib.request.urlopen(req, context=ctx) as resp:\\n    access_token = json.loads(resp.read().decode('utf-8'))['access_token']\\n\\nurl = 'https://mdm-api.concung.com/api/Permissions/ReadClient?clientName=scm.concung.com&enviroment=STG'\\nreq = urllib.request.Request(url, headers={\\n    'Authorization': f'Bearer {access_token}',\\n    'Accept': 'application/json'\\n}, method='GET')\\n\\nwith urllib.request.urlopen(req, context=ctx) as resp:\\n    body = resp.read().decode('utf-8')\\n    data = json.loads(body)\\n    perms = data.get('Permission', [])\\n    mods = data.get('Module', [])\\n    deps = data.get('UserDepartments', [])\\n    print(f'https://mdm-api.concung.com: Permission count={len(perms)}, Module count={len(mods)}, UserDept count={len(deps)}')\\n    if perms:\\