{"step_index":10991,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-14T04:03:41Z","thinking":"Wave A and B are completed. The plan specifies Wave C involves Phase 2 journeys, permission matrix, and state. The information on Wave E and F needs to be located.\n\n\nThe goal is to create a script to execute Wave E tests efficiently and identify migration bugs quickly. The script needs to iterate through screen folders, excluding specified ones, and run tests with a fail-fast approach. After a test run, it checks the exit code to distinguish between migration bugs and test-specific issues.\nThe script should stop immediately on encountering a true migration bug, but continue running after encountering a known skip or test bug. The script will be written in Python or PowerShell.\nA runner script is needed.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"import os\\nimport subprocess\\nimport sys\\nimport json\\n\\n# Danh sách các màn đã chạy ở Wave A, B, C, D (không cần chạy lại)\\nALREADY_TESTED = {\\n    'login', 'home', 'journeys',\\n    'output-orders', 'purchase-orders', 'store-change-requests', 'input-orders', 'invoices'\\n}\\n\\ndef get_remaining_screens():\\n    e2e_dir = os.path.join(os.getcwd(), 'e2e')\\n    folders = sorted(os.listdir(e2e_dir))\\n    remaining = []\\n    for f in folders:\\n        spec_path = os.path.join(e2e_dir, f, f\\\"{f}.e2e.spec.ts\\\")\\n        if os.path.exists(spec_path) and f not in ALREADY_TESTED:\\n            remaining.append((f, spec_path))\\n    return remaining\\n\\nif __name__ == '__main__':\\n    screens = get_remaining_screens()\\n    print(f\\\"Total remaining screens for Wave E: {len(screens)}\\\")\\n    # In ra 10 màn đầu tiên để kiểm tra thứ tự\\n    for name, path in screens[:10]:\\n        print(f\\\" - {name}\\\")\\n\"","Description":"\"List remaining screens for Wave E\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\25303_TruongVanTinh\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity-ide\\\\brain\\\\3fcfde30-4110-403c-8f9f-a4ed95abc9e6\\\\scratch\\\\run_wave_e.py\"","toolAction":"\"Write run_wave_e.py\"","toolSummary":"\"Create Wave E helper script\""}}]}
