{"step_index":18176,"source":"MODEL","type":"VIEW_FILE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-15T02:09:43Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-15T09:09:43+07:00\nCompleted At: 2026-10-15T09:09:43+07:00\nFile Path: `file:///E:/Work/Place_Migrate/cci-scm-web/03_qa/Makefile.windows`\nTotal Lines: 129\nTotal Bytes: 7727\nShowing lines 80 to 129\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n80: \tpowershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File scripts\\kill-ports.win.ps1 $(API_PORT) $(WEB_PORT)\n81: \n82: # Build + start scm-api + scm-web (net10_mssql) trực tiếp, không tự stop, không chạy test.\n83: start-api:\n84: \tpowershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File scripts\\start-env.win.ps1 -Variant mssql\n85: \n86: start-web: start-api\n87: \n88: stop-api:\n89: \tpowershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File scripts\\stop-env.win.ps1\n90: \n91: stop-web: stop-api\n92: \n93: stop-all: stop-api\n94: start-all: start-api\n95: \n96: # Chạy test (net10_mssql) + sinh HTML report + fail-list.\n97: # Luôn sinh report kể cả khi test fail (đó chính là lúc report cần nhất) — không dùng test-local\n98: # làm prerequisite (make dừng ngay khi nó lỗi, bỏ qua generate-report.js luôn). `&` (không phải\n99: # `&&`) chạy lệnh sau bất kể errorlevel; lưu errorlevel vào ST rồi exit /b %ST% để giữ đúng mã lỗi\n100: # test cho CI, giống pattern `status=$$?; ...; exit $$status` của Makefile (bash) song song.\n101: test-report:\n102: \t@$(MAKE) -f Makefile.windows -s test-local & set \"ST=%ERRORLEVEL%\" & node scripts\\generate-report.js reports/details/test-mssql-report-latest.json --no-open & exit /b %ST%\n103: \n104: # Đẩy report JSON mới nhất lên GCS + ReportTest (cũng tự chạy cuối run-e2e.win.ps1).\n105: #   make -f Makefile.windows upload-report PREFIX=test-net4\n106: #   make -f Makefile.windows upload-report ARGS=reports/details/<file>.json\n107: upload-report:\n108: \t@node --use-system-ca scripts\\upload-report.js $(if $(PREFIX),--prefix $(PREFIX),$(ARGS))\n109: \n110: clean: kill-ports\n111: \t-powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -Command \"Remove-Item -Recurse -Force allure-results,allure-report,node_modules,test-results -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue\"\n112: \n113: status:\n114: \t@echo APP_ENV=$(APP_ENV) API_PORT=$(API_PORT) WEB_PORT=$(WEB_PORT)\n115: \n116: # Upload report → portal tập trung (scripts/upload-report.js), tự chạy sau mỗi `make -f Makefile.windows test-*`.\n117: #   make -f Makefile.windows upload-report PREFIX=test-net10-mssql            # file mới nhất\n118: #   make -f Makefile.windows upload-report ARGS=reports/details/<file>.json   # 1 file cụ thể\n119: upload-report:\n120: \t@node --use-system-ca scripts\\upload-report.js $(if $(PREFIX),--prefix $(PREFIX),$(ARGS))\n121: \n122: # Gate THUẦN MAKE, KHÔNG LLM — dùng cuối `qa-regen-web` (xem .opencode/command/qa-regen-web.md\n123: # + docs/qa-toolkit/QA-TOOLKIT-WEB.md). Không chạy Playwright thật ở đây.\n124: # check-dimension-coverage: port từ mbm — hiện plan SCM chưa có Phase 0b nên KHÔNG gắn hard-gate\n125: # (chạy tay: python ..\\scripts\\check-dimension-coverage.py --list-gap-screens).\n126: qa-verify-web: typecheck\n127: \tpython ..\\scripts\\oracle-lock-screen.py --check\n128: \tpython ..\\scripts\\check-plan-vs-spec.py\n129: \nThe above content does NOT show the entire file contents. If you need to view any lines of the file which were not shown to complete your task, call this tool again to view those lines.\n"}
