{"step_index":18215,"source":"MODEL","type":"VIEW_FILE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-15T02:11:45Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-15T09:11:45+07:00\nCompleted At: 2026-10-15T09:11:45+07:00\nFile Path: `file:///E:/Work/Place_Migrate/cci-dc-api/03_qa/.env`\nTotal Lines: 57\nTotal Bytes: 3261\nShowing lines 1 to 57\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1: # hrm-api — Playwright test env template (copy to .env, which is gitignored)\r\n2: #   make -f Makefile.windows setup    # tạo .env từ file này (lần đầu)\r\n3: #\r\n4: # Bearer token is fetched dynamically by the `setup` project (fixtures/auth.fixture.ts) via\r\n5: # real ids1-Keycloak SSO login (TEST_USERNAME/TEST_PASSWORD + IDS1_* below) → written to\r\n6: # .auth/token.json. This is the only token source (utils/auth-helpers.ts's loadAuthHeaders()).\r\n7: #\r\n8: # APP_ENV không set ở đây — cả 3 lệnh chạy test (make test-net10-mssql/test-net10-posgresql/\r\n9: # test-net4-mssql) đều tự truyền APP_ENV=... thẳng trên command line (xem Makefile), giá trị này\r\n10: # (nếu có) sẽ bị ghi đè nên không cần đặt default ở đây.\r\n11: \r\n12: # NET10_MSSQL: URL này quyết định `make test-net10-mssql` test vào ĐÂU.\r\n13: #   localhost / 127.0.0.1 -> Makefile tự build + start 02_target/net10_mssql trên port trong URL,\r\n14: #                            chạy test xong tự tắt (port 5102 = <runPorts> trong ../app.config)\r\n15: #   host remote           -> gọi thẳng, KHÔNG start gì (vd bản NET10 đã deploy: hrm-api-stg10)\r\n16: NET10_MSSQL_BASE_URL=http://localhost:5114\r\n17: \r\n18: # NET4_MSSQL: bản .NET Framework 4.6.1 gốc (chưa migrate), MSSQL — remote stg4\r\n19: # (không start local được; OWIN/IIS-only). DB: staging 192.168.13.135/HRM (../app.config).\r\n20: NET4_MSSQL_BASE_URL=https://dc-api-stg4.concung.vn/\r\n21: \r\n22: # NET10_POSGRESQL: tương tự NET10_MSSQL (localhost -> tự start net10_postgresql :5202; remote -> gọi thẳng)\r\n23: \r\n24: # DB mà API đang dùng (staging, xem ../app.config) — utils/dbclean (make clean-db) xoá test rows\r\n25: # QC-TEST-* ở đây.\r\n26: QA_DB_HOST=192.168.13.135\r\n27: QA_DB_NAME=Purchase\r\n28: QA_DB_USER=perf_stage\r\n29: QA_DB_PASSWORD=XA2Pp0QvYqlhcFYzVh76\r\n30: \r\n31: # SSO credentials (Keycloak ids1) — tài khoản test: 2741 / ConcungIT123\r\n32: # (xem .agents/tools/auth_v1/README.md)\r\n33: TEST_USERNAME=Doan.Do@vn.rhenus.com\r\n34: TEST_PASSWORD=Concung789\r\n35: \r\n36: # ids1-Keycloak login (fixtures/auth.fixture.ts implicit flow) — dùng cho mọi APP_ENV\r\n37: # (NET10_*, NET4_MSSQL đều validate token ký bởi realm ids1-stg — IDSUrl trong ../app.config).\r\n38: # Không cần client secret (browser implicit flow); redirect URI đã whitelist sẵn phía ids1.\r\n39: IDS1_URL=https://ids1-stg.concung.vn/realms/master\r\n40: IDS1_CLIENT_ID=CCI.Swagger.ClientCredential\r\n41: IDS1_SCOPE=CCI.Swagger\r\n42: IDS1_REDIRECT_URI=http://localhost:5575/swagger/oauth2-redirect.html\r\n43: \r\n44: # Upload report → portal tập trung (scripts/upload-report.js, tự chạy sau mỗi `make test-*`, tắt: upload=0).\r\n45: # JSON report lên GCS qua presign (token = .auth/token.json của lần test), rồi ghi 1 dòng vào\r\n46: # ReportTest.public.test_report (PostgreSQL, bắt buộc SSL).\r\n47: # Mật khẩu có `#` phải bọc nháy đơn: dotenv coi `#` là đầu comment, cắt mất phần sau → Postgres báo\r\n48: # \"password authentication failed\". Nháy đơn cũng giữ nguyên `$`.\r\n49: TESTREPORTER_DB_HOST=192.168.13.223\r\n50: TESTREPORTER_DB_NAME=ReportTest\r\n51: TESTREPORTER_DB_USER=pnhlong\r\n52: TESTREPORTER_DB_PASSWORD='Llcoc$12#@abC!*'\r\n53: TESTREPORTER_PROJECT=11_DC\r\n54: TESTREPORTER_GCS_API=https://wap-gcs-api-stg.concung.vn/api/gcs/public/getpresignedlink\r\n55: TESTREPORTER_GCS_MODULE=none\r\n56: QA_DB_NAME_MDM=MDM\r\n57: \nThe above content shows the entire, complete file contents of the requested file.\n"}
